Code.buildings_bld_house_description,A higher quality 'old world' house that can actually be called home.
Code.buildings_bld_hq_name,Headquarters
Code.buildings_bld_hq_description,"This is your center of operations. From here, the Operator commands the units. This is your last line of defense, protect it at all costs.\n\nThe HQ hosts Squads and allows the creation of new ones. It has a small-capacity warehouse, and also provides a shelter of questionable comfort for a few citizens."
Code.buildings_bld_kitchen_name,Cookhouse
Code.buildings_bld_kitchen_description,Organized food distribution reduces wasted food and allows you to prepare meals from raw food.
Code.buildings_bld_shelter_name,Shelter
Code.buildings_bld_shelter_description,The most basic shelter that will keep the citizens warm and secure at night.
Code.buildings_bld_warehouse_name,Warehouse
Code.buildings_bld_warehouse_description,Place where all produced and scavenged resources can be stored.
Code.buildings_bld_fortified_tower_name,Fortified tower
Code.buildings_bld_fortified_tower_description,"A fortified construction on a platform made of durable materials to protect shooters from the infected.\nOnce built, it must be equipped with weapons and ammunition."
Code.buildings_bld_metal_tower_name,Metal Tower
Code.buildings_bld_metal_tower_description,"A construction on a platform made of durable materials to protect shooters from the infected.\nOnce built, it must be equipped with weapons and ammunition."
Code.buildings_bld_wooden_tower_name,Wooden tower
Code.buildings_bld_wooden_tower_description,"A light construction with an elevation that allows you to shoot at enemies.\nOnce built, it must be equipped with weapons and ammunition."
Code.buildings_bld_barbed_wire_name,Barbed wire
Code.buildings_bld_barbed_wire_description,It hinders and injures the infected that try to pass through it.
Code.buildings_bld_brick_wall_name,Brick Wall
Code.buildings_bld_brick_wall_description,A durable defensive structure to protect the zone from the infected.
Code.buildings_bld_fortified_wall_name,Fortified Wall
Code.buildings_bld_fortified_wall_description,A high and durable defensive structure made of concrete. Much higher and more durable than all the other types of walls.
Code.buildings_bld_metal_fence_name,Metal Fence
Code.buildings_bld_metal_fence_description,A very durable fence made mainly of metal.
Code.buildings_bld_wooden_palisade_name,Wooden Palisade
Code.buildings_bld_wooden_palisade_description,"A basic fortification against the infected. Made of wood, it is easy to damage."
Code.buildings_bld_greenhouse_name,Greenhouse
Code.buildings_bld_greenhouse_description,"A cultivation space covered with transparent panels. Plants inside grow faster, which makes the cultivation much more efficient."
Code.buildings_bld_abandoned_description,Scavenge abandoned buildings for valuable resources. Watch out for the infected lurking inside. You can also adapt the searched buildings to functions useful for your zone.
Code.buildings_bld_barn_name,Barn
Code.buildings_bld_barn_description,A building serving as a shelter for livestock. Animal breeding allows you to obtain meat that is used to prepare dishes in the kitchen.
Code.buildings_bld_butchery_name,Butchery
Code.buildings_bld_butchery_description,Beats and cuts the animal carcasses to produce raw meat portions.
Code.buildings_bld_cans_factory_name,Cannery
Code.buildings_bld_cans_factory_description,Processing raw foods and packing them into cans.
Code.buildings_bld_research_center_name,Research Center
Code.buildings_bld_research_center_description,"Workers assigned to the Research Center develop new technologies using scientific materials. When they are not working on a specific technology, they can produce scientific materials."
Code.buildings_bld_medbay_name,Medbay
Code.buildings_bld_medbay_description,"Workers assigned to the Medbay heal all other workers and squad members who occupy hospital beds in the Medbay.\n\nAfter researching Drugs Production in the Research Center, it also enables the production of First Aid Kits."
Code.buildings_bld_sawmill_name,Sawmill
Code.buildings_bld_sawmill_description,"Workers assigned here will chop down nearby trees. Building itself improves the processing efficiency, allowing for a better yield per chopped tree."
Code.buildings_bld_temple_name,Temple
Code.buildings_bld_temple_description,A place of religious worship. It provides residents with respite and time for reflection.
Code.buildings_bld_tool_factory_name,Tool Factory
Code.buildings_bld_tool_factory_description,It allows you to produce tools used on farms and in other types of factories.
Code.buildings_bld_carworkshop_name,Vehicle Workshop
Code.buildings_bld_carworkshop_description,Repairs and modernizes motor vehicles using manual labor.
Code.buildings_bld_wooden_gate_name,Wooden Gate
Code.buildings_bld_wooden_gate_description,It allows you to freely walk and block the passage through the palisade.
Code.buildings_bld_metal_gate_name,Metal Gate
Code.buildings_bld_metal_gate_description,A heavy gate that allows you to pass through a metal fence.
Code.buildings_bld_fortified_gate_name,Fortified Gate
Code.buildings_bld_fortified_gate_description,A large and solid gate that allows you to pass through a fortified wall.
