Code.buildings_bld_forum_description,A place where all the citizens of the zone can meet and pass new laws.
Code.buildings_bld_medieval_wall_name,Medieval Wall
Code.buildings_bld_medieval_wall_description,"An old defensive structure, very durable and strong against the infected."
