Code.buildings_bld_gear_factory_name,Protective Gear Factory
Code.buildings_bld_gear_factory_description,It allows you to produce gear worn by squad members that enhances their capabilities.
Code.buildings_bld_kindergarten_name,Kindergarten
Code.buildings_bld_kindergarten_description,This is the place where parents can leave their children and go to work. Provide care for the children to increase population growth and to satisfy the needs of your citizens
