Code.buildings_bld_shooting_range_description,This building allows training of Sharpshooter and Slasher skills. Squads will use their assigned weapons and ammunition for practice. 
Code.buildings_bld_squad_quarters_name,Squad Quarters
Code.buildings_bld_squad_quarters_description,Hosts more squads and allows the creation of new ones. This is the place where they can gather and rest. 
