"INTRO_0:00:00.880,0:00:02.960",The world as we know it is gone.
"INTRO_0:00:04.720,0:00:07.840",What we call the Mad Virus appeared out of nowhere.
"INTRO_0:00:09.520,0:00:11.840","It made people turn extremely violent,"
"INTRO_0:00:11.840,0:00:13.520",aggressive and unrestrainable.
"INTRO_0:00:14.640,0:00:17.440","Soon after, the Infected became bloodthirsty…"
"INTRO_0:00:18.080,0:00:19.840",more like vampires than human.
"INTRO_0:00:21.440,0:00:24.480","There was chaos, panic and war for survival."
"INTRO_0:00:25.040,0:00:29.840",Desperate people were just as \r\ndangerous as the virus itself.
"INTRO_0:00:30.400,0:00:31.440",Even our loved ones…
"INTRO_0:00:32.800,0:00:33.680",could become a threat.
"INTRO_0:00:34.720,0:00:37.760",The Infection spread quickly \r\nthrough the entire globe
"INTRO_0:00:38.320,0:00:41.200","every region, every country, every city."
"INTRO_0:00:42.240,0:00:45.120","Drastic measures were taken \nto get rid of the infected,"
"INTRO_0:00:45.120,0:00:46.080",but they all failed…
"INTRO_0:00:48.240,0:00:50.480",The last chance for those who seemed immune
"INTRO_0:00:50.480,0:00:52.400",was to hide in underground shelters…
"INTRO_0:00:53.120,0:00:56.000","ones that we improvised in garages and basements,"
"INTRO_0:00:56.640,0:00:59.520","loaded with food, water and air filtration systems"
"INTRO_0:01:00.720,0:01:02.720","These were the places where we survived,"
"INTRO_0:01:03.280,0:01:04.640",sealed from the outside.
"INTRO_0:01:06.640,0:01:09.520","For so long, we waited for any signal."
"INTRO_0:01:10.320,0:01:12.800",Any info that a cure have been found
"INTRO_0:01:12.800,0:01:14.560",or the situation stabilized.
"INTRO_0:01:15.440,0:01:18.960","Instead, we listened as the world go quiet."
"INTRO_0:01:21.920,0:01:23.840",Our resources were becoming depleted…
"INTRO_0:01:24.640,0:01:26.480",life support systems were failing…
"INTRO_0:01:28.080,0:01:30.480",and just as we were losing all hope…
"INTRO_0:01:30.480,0:01:32.400",we received a distant call:
"INTRO_0:01:35.120,0:01:38.480","""To all survivors… The infection is in decline…"""
"INTRO_0:01:38.480,0:01:39.840","""Seek others and rebuild…"""
"INTRO_0:01:42.160,0:01:44.080",This was the impulse we needed.
"INTRO_0:01:45.120,0:01:46.400",There were others out there!
"INTRO_0:01:47.600,0:01:49.200",We can come back to the surface!
"INTRO_0:01:50.160,0:01:51.120",No more hiding!
"INTRO_0:01:52.880,0:01:54.560",From the ruins of the old world…
"INTRO_0:01:55.360,0:02:07.840",we will build our new home.
"INTRO_0:02:07.840,0:02:11.813",WISHLIST AND FOLLOW ON STEAM
