research_tech_tool_factory,Tool Factory
research_description_tech_tool_factory,"Unlocks the Tool Factory, which produces tools necessary for farms and other types of factories, a Sawmill to optimise tree-cutting, and the Repairmen Shop which allows them to repair other buildings and structures without disturbing its work"
research_tech_repellents,Repellents
research_description_tech_repellents,"It masks the smell of workers, reducing the risk of infected people attacking buildings with workers."
research_tech_feromones,Feromones
research_description_tech_feromones,"Masks the scent of squads, making them less susceptible to detection by the infected."
research_tech_cure_drugs,Drug therapy
research_description_tech_cure_drugs,Some infected can be tamed and treated as basic workforce.
research_type_food,Food
research_tech_first_aid,First Aid
research_description_tech_first_aid,Citizens treat themselves more efficiently.
research_tech_surgery,Surgery
