research_tech_adv_metalworks,Advanced metalworks
research_description_tech_adv_metalworks,"Advanced metallurgy will allow to construct new, robust buildings with metal frames. Furthermore, full plate armor production will be enabled in the Protective Equipment Factory"
research_tech_adv_brickworks,Advanced masonry
research_description_tech_adv_brickworks,Unlocks defensive structures with the highest possible structure condition. Fortified gates and towers also have more space to assign guards.\n\nIt also unlocks the possibility to construct new buildings for adaptation.
research_tech_farming,Farming
research_description_tech_farming,Improves crop yield on farms.
research_tech_farming_adv,Fertilization techniques
research_description_tech_farming_adv,Enables the use of fertilizers on farms.
research_tech_farming_greenhouse,Greenhouses
research_description_tech_farming_greenhouse,Unlocks the construction of greenhouses where you can grow agricultural produce.
research_tech_food_conservation,Food preservation
research_description_tech_food_conservation,"Unlocks the cannery, which extends the shelf life of food."
research_tech_eff_feeding,Efficient cooking
research_description_tech_eff_feeding,Speeds up food preparation in kitchens.
research_tech_hunting,Hunting
research_description_tech_hunting,"Unlocks the Hunter's House, where you can employ workers who collect wild game meat."
research_tech_weather_forecast,Weather Forecast
research_description_tech_weather_forecast,"Unlocks the Weather Center, whose employees forecast future weather and meteorological events."
research_tech_arm_shotgun,Shotgun
research_description_tech_arm_shotgun,It allows the production of firearms with high stopping power. Production takes place in a weapons factory and it is very effective in close-range combat.
research_type_tech_gears,Protective Gear Production
research_tech_polymers,Polymers
research_description_tech_polymers,"New polymerization, polyaddition and polycondensation processes are used to produce useful artificial fabrics and hard plastics from fuel. This technology allows the production of Protectors and Riot Gear at Protective Equipment Factory."
research_tech_protectors,Protectors
research_description_tech_protectors,Allows to produce Protectors at Protective Gear Factory.
research_tech_riotgear,Riot Gear
research_description_tech_riotgear,Allows to produce Riot Gear at Protective Gear Factory.
research_tech_fermentation,Fermentation
research_description_tech_fermentation,"The study of chemical processes that occur during grain malting and fermentation allows the development of conditions in which high-quality beverages will be produced. This technology allows the adaptation of buildings to a bar, where employees will prepare beverages for residents."
research_tech_vaccine,Vaccine
research_description_tech_vaccine,"The vaccine prevents any new infection of our citizens. As the virus mutates, a new batch of vaccine must be researched every year"
research_tech_inf_diagnosis,Early diagnosis
research_tech_inf_symptoms,Symptomatic treatment
research_tech_inf_turning,Turning prevention
research_tech_inf_doses,Dosing optimisation
research_description_tech_inf_diagnosis,Lowers the chances of falling ill by {0}
research_description_tech_inf_symptoms,"Infected citizens need 3 days of treatment to recover. After developing this technology, the illness might be treated {0} days faster."
research_description_tech_inf_turning,Critically ill are more likely to die and less likely to turn.
research_description_tech_inf_doses,The ill require less medicine.
research_tech_mechanics,Mechanics
research_description_tech_mechanics,Unlocks car workshops where basic car models are produced.
research_tech_adv_mechanics,Advanced Mechanics
research_description_tech_adv_mechanics,Allows you to modify vehicles in the car workshop.
research_tech_recycling,Recycling
research_description_tech_recycling,"Technology for metal recovery and smelting. Unlocks the Scrapyard building, where workers produce raw metal from all kinds of waste generated during repairs, deconstructions, and even from spent ammunition."
research_tech_survival_training,Survival Training
research_description_tech_survival_training,Develops training methods for every survivor to help them deal with the current reality. Unlocks skill training for squads.
research_tech_combat_training,Combat Training
research_description_tech_combat_training,Research methods of training that will turn ordinary survivors into professional soldiers. Unlocks a Shooting Range where squads can practice their combat skills - accuracy and melee in particular.
research_tech_nursery,Nursery
research_description_tech_nursery,"Research methods of professional childcare. \nUnlocks a Kindergarten where children are taken care of, improving the moods in the zone in the process"
research_tech_fisherman,Fishery
research_description_tech_fisherman,"Research how to breed fish for food and how to make nets. Unlocks the Fisherman's Hut, which can be built on the shores of bodies of water to produce meat."
