dilemma_bandit_01_contact.dialog.1,"Sir, we spotted some people, probably armed. They could've seen us too. I can't tell if they are friendly. What should we do?"
dilemma_bandit_01_contact.dialog.opt_openfire,{TREAT THEM AS HOSTILE} Treat them as hostile.
dilemma_bandit_01_contact.dialog.opt_approach,{APPROACH FRIENDLY} Approach them friendly.
