dilemma_lore_virus_underground.dialog.1,"Sir, the people have reported hearing a lot of noises coming from underground. They're afraid that it could be the infected moving through the sewers and tunnels. We need to bolster our defenses and be ready for an attack from within as well."
dilemma_lore_virus_underground.dialog.opt_ok,{NOT IMPORTANT} Tell them it's nothing
dilemma_lore_virus_underground.dialog.opt_okk,{LET'S PREPARE} We will be ready.
dilemma_lore_virus_cannibal.dialog.1,"Operator, we saw something grisly, but… potentially useful. The infected are eating their own. We saw some of them inside a basement they couldn’t get out of. There were corpses of other infected obviously eaten."
dilemma_lore_virus_cannibal.dialog.opt_ok,{LEAVE THEM} Leave them to rot down there. 
dilemma_lore_virus_cannibal.dialog.opt_kill,{KILL THEM} Kill them all!
dilemma_lore_virus_cannibal.dialog.spotted,Roger that... Oh shit! They spotted us!
dilemma_bgmilitary_01_tracks.dilemma_bgmilitary_01_tracks,Tire tracks
dilemma_bgmilitary_01_tracks.dialog.1,"Sir, we found some trails. Looks like a few cars passed through here recently, but what's more curious, one of the vehicles must have had tracks instead of tires... maybe it was some kind of bulldozer, or a tank?"
dilemma_bgmilitary_01_tracks.dialog.opt_ok,"{ROGER THAT} Roger that, be careful."
dilemma_bgmilitary_02_postbattle_scene.dilemma_bgmilitary_02_postbattle_scene,Shootout traces
dilemma_bgmilitary_02_postbattle_scene.dialog.1,"Operator, there are signs of a shootout here. We found like fifty infected bodies... they must have been killed by some high-caliber, precision headshots. Whoever it was, they were pros!"
dilemma_bgmilitary_02_postbattle_scene.dialog.opt_ok,"{UNDERSTOOD} Understood, watch yourselves."
dilemma_tutorial_start_scavenging.dialog.1,"Operator, this is first squad leader. We made our way out. The neighborhood looks deserted. We'll have to scavenge the nearby buildings for any useful resources."
dilemma_tutorial_start_scavenging.dialog.2,"{LOOK FOR FOOD} OK, find something to eat as fast as possible."
dilemma_tutorial_start_scavenging_end.dialog.1,"Sir, the crates are in the HQ. We have to think what to scavenge next. It would be best to check some shops or warehouses."
dilemma_tutorial_start_scavenging_end.dialog.2,"{OK} Ok, I will point you where to go"
dilemma_tutorial_missing_houses.dialog.1,"Chief, I will speak on behalf of the other citizens. Let’s go and adapt the buildings to suitable shelters so we don't spend one more night underground."
dilemma_tutorial_missing_houses.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} Yes, that sounds like a good idea."
dilemma_tutorial_first_defense.dialog.1,"This night was easy, but there are sure to be some infected around here. We should build some defenses before nightfall."
dilemma_tutorial_first_defense.dialog.2,"{LET'S BUILD A WATCHTOWER} Agreed, let's build a watchtower."
dilemma_tutorial_chop_trees.dialog.1,"Chief, if we want to build anything else, we need more resources. Send workers to chop down some trees. Maybe we could build some palisades with that, too."
dilemma_tutorial_chop_trees.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} OK, let's gather some wood."
dilemma_tutorial_smoke_start.dialog.1,"Chief, there are signs of smoke. It's coming from a building… I think there might be some people in there. I recommend we go and investigate."
dilemma_tutorial_smoke_start.dialog.opt_ok,{INVESTIGATE} Let's investigate.
dilemma_tutorial_create_squad.dialog.1,We should create another squad before we investigate. We can't be sure who we're gonna find there.
dilemma_tutorial_create_squad.dialog.2,"{CREATE NEW SQUAD} OK, let's do this."
dilemma_tutorial_smoke_end.dialog.1,"Chief, we found some survivors. They've been living in terrible conditions for the last few years… We could bring them in, but will we be able to feed them?"
dilemma_tutorial_smoke_end.dialog.2,{ACCEPT SURVIVORS} Bring them in.
dilemma_tutorial_smoke_end.dialog.3,{LEAVE SURVIVORS} We can't accept them now.
dilemma_tutorial_smoke_epilogue.dialog.1,"Chief, the survivors that we took in… they have some important info we could use. They speak of various kinds of infected animals that they encountered, and other groups of survivors, too… but they've lost people recently. It will take some time for them to integrate. Let me find some jobs and shelter for them."
dilemma_tutorial_smoke_epilogue.dialog.2,"{LET THEM REST} OK, let them rest."
dilemma_tutorial_smoke_epilogue.dialog.3,{INTERROGATE THEM} We have no time for that. Interrogate them now and get as much info as you can.
dilemma_tutorial_warehouse.dialog.1,"Boss, we are running out of space for resources. We have to build a warehouse."
dilemma_tutorial_warehouse.dialog.opt_ok,"{LET'S BUILD IT} OK, we will build one."
dilemma_tutorial_second_night.dialog.1,"Sir, it's almost nightfall… and we can already see some infected coming out of their lairs."
dilemma_tutorial_second_night.dialog.2,"{GET READY} OK, get ready to defend the zone."
dilemma_tutorial_unlock_cars_start.dialog.1,"Sir, we just found a car that looks salvageable. Let's try to make it run again."
dilemma_tutorial_unlock_cars_start.dialog.2,"{OK} OK, try it."
dilemma_tutorial_unlock_cars_end.dialog.1,"I've missed driving so much… This will help speed up our scavenging, and we can run over the infected if they get too close!"
dilemma_tutorial_unlock_cars_end.dialog.2,{OK} We're gonna see.
dilemma_tutorial_free_workers.dialog.1,"Chief, many of our workers don't have any jobs. Send them to gather resources, construct, or work at some of the buildings."
dilemma_tutorial_free_workers.dialog.opt_ok,{OK} We're gonna see.
dilemma_unlock_farm.dialog.1,"Chief, we found some seeds in one of the buildings. It looks like grain. There were some farming tools as well... Maybe we could use this to start cultivating the land again."
dilemma_unlock_farm.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} OK, bring it in."
dilemma_unlock_farm.dialog.opt_not,{NOT OK} We do not sow!
dilemma_unlock_farm.dialog.kitchen,"We should have a place where we can cook meals for our citizens. This will make our people much happier, too."
dilemma_unlock_farm.dialog.kitchen_ok,"{OK} OK, let's build a Cookhouse."
dilemma_tutorial_gather_metal.dialog.1,"We are going to need some metal, too. Car wreckages can be a good source. Or we can deconstruct some buildings. Send workers to do that. "
dilemma_tutorial_gather_metal.dialog.opt_ok,{OK} Let's go there.\r\n
dilemma_tutorial_build_antenna.dialog.1,"Now we are ready to build an antenna. Once it is operational, we will be ready to receive distant transmissions again, and broadcast something ourselves!"
dilemma_tutorial_build_antenna.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} OK, let's do this."
dilemma_tutorial_first_night.dialog.1,"Sir, the sun is getting low. We don't know what's gonna happen at night. We can continue our scavenging operations in the dark, but that will be way more dangerous than waiting until sunrise."
dilemma_tutorial_first_night.dialog.2,{GET BACK TO HQ} Everyone should be back in HQ.
dilemma_tutorial_first_night.dialog.citizen2,The workers will return home too. Unarmed civilians should not walk after dark.
dilemma_tutorial_first_night.dialog.4,{OK} Acknowledged… Stay safe.
dilemma_tutorial_first_night.dialog.3,"{CONTINUE} Carry on, we need those resources."
dilemma_tutorial_first_night.dialog.citizen1,"Sir, it is too dangerous for unarmed civilians to work after nightfall. The workers will return home."
dilemma_tutorial_first_night.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} OK, let's be safe."
dilemma_tutorial_first_horde_spotted.dialog.1,"Sir, we just saw a group of infected. They might not be aware of our presence yet… "
dilemma_tutorial_first_horde_spotted.dialog.2,{GET READY} Get ready to fight.
dilemma_tutorial_first_horde_spotted.dialog.3,{HIDE} We will stay away from them. 
dilemma_tutorial_broadcast.dialog.1,"Chief, the antenna is now operational… Let's broadcast an invitation as a test, or just call the squads back to HQ."
dilemma_tutorial_broadcast.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} OK, let's start broadcasting."
dilemma_eq_assault_rifle.dialog.1,"Chief, we just found an assault rifle! This will come in handy against large hordes. Let's just not waste too much ammo on nothing. "
dilemma_eq_assault_rifle.dialog.ok,{OK} Use it with caution.
dilemma_tutorial_winter.dialog.1,"Sir, winter is coming. The days will be shorter and the farms won't produce any more food. We should brace ourselves – these might be the hardest days of the year."
dilemma_tutorial_winter.dialog.opt_ok,{PREPARE FOR WINTER} Let's prepare for winter.
dilemma_tutorial_research_radio_lab.dialog.1,We need a workspace where we can experiment and reengineer all the pre-pandemic technology. We could store all the books there too. Let's build a research center and assign the most technical minds there. 
dilemma_tutorial_research_radio_lab.dialog.ok,"{OK} Ok, let's do this. "
dilemma_tutorial_deconstruct.dialog.1,"Chief, if we deconstructed some buildings, we could acquire some wood, metal and bricks for other constructions. We would have some more space for other constructions as well, or just a clear line of fire. "
dilemma_tutorial_deconstruct.dialog.opt_ok,"{DECONSTRUCT} Ok, let's take it down."
dilemma_unlock_barn.dialog.1,"Operator, we found an abandoned farmstead. There are some chickens running around. They seem to have gone wild, but maybe we can breed them if we make a proper place for that?"
dilemma_unlock_barn.dialog.opt_ok,"{TAKE THEM} Catch them, we'll give it a shot."
dilemma_tutorial_partial_adaptation.dialog.1,"Chief, this building is way too big for us to adapt as a whole. It will cost us too many resources. But we can still adapt it partially, and convert only as much space as we need."
dilemma_tutorial_partial_adaptation.dialog.opt_ok,"{GOOD IDEA} Ok, you are right. Let's do this. "
dilemma_tutorial_partial_adaptation.dialog.opt_leave,{LEAVE IT} Let's leave it as it is. We will manage.
dilemma_lore_gen_curenews.dialog.1,"Sir, we've found an old survivor's hideout. Unfortunately he's been dead for a long time. He had a lot of electronics, and one of his computers had some data concerning work on a vaccine or a cure... it suggests that significant progress was made."
dilemma_lore_gen_curenews.dialog.opt_search,"{BRING THAT IN} Ok, send that data and bring in all of it."
dilemma_lore_gen_curenews.dialog.gotsomething,One more thing... *rustling and hitting keyboard* There are some coordinates of possible lab locations. Should we check them out?
dilemma_lore_gen_curenews.dialog.goforit,"{YES} Yes, let's check them."
dilemma_megastorm.dialog.1,"Operator, do you see these clouds? I've never seen such a big storm. The sky's so dark that the infected might be able to walk in clouds' shadow during the day! We need to be vigilant."
dilemma_megastorm.dialog.opt_ok,"{GOOD POINT} Good point, let's stay on guard."
dilemma_supermoon.dialog.1,It is full moon tonight. The sky is perfectly clear. It's almost as bright as a day. There should be no infected on the streets tonight.
dilemma_supermoon.dialog.opt_ok,{WE CAN WORK TONIGHT} It seems that we can work safely tonight then.
dilemma_supermoon.dialog.opt_okk,{IT'S STILL RISKY} I'd rather take no chances. I don't think it's safe to go out tonight.
dilemma_supermoon.dialog.opt_good,"{GOOD FOR US} That's good, we can use a quiet night."
dilemma_tutorial_first_aid.dialog.1,"Chief, we've found some medical supplies. They'll definitely come in handy. Now we'll be able to give first aid to the wounded. But if we want to heal people more efficiently, we'll need to build a medbay."
dilemma_tutorial_first_aid.dialog.opt_okk,{OK} A medbay sounds like a good idea. We'll think of that.
dilemma_gear_need.dialog.1,"One of our guys just got wounded badly. We could really use some protective gear. Kevlar, steel, reinforced plastic, whatever keeps us alive."
dilemma_gear_need.dialog.opt_ok,"{LET'S FIND SOME} You're right, we'll try to find some."
dilemma_gear_need.dialog.opt_okk,"{LET'S MAKE SOME} You're right, we will find a way to make some"
dilemma_elderly.dialog.1,"Operator, some of our older citizens can barely do their jobs. It's terrible to make them work at this age. I think we should have some place where the elderly could get some rest until they pass away. "
dilemma_elderly.dialog.opt_ok,"{LET'S BUILD A COMMON ROOM} Let's build a common room then, gramps did their fair share of work already."
dilemma_elderly.dialog.opt_notok,{MAKE THEM WORK} We can't afford to feed anybody who doesn't work. They need to carry on.
dilemma_tutorial_wood.dialog.1,"Chief, there are no trees around the zone and we are running out of wood. We should either plant trees or deconstruct some buildings. We can employ some workers as foresters, or we can just order trees to be planted in a certain area. Either way, we’ll have to wait a few years before we cut them."
dilemma_tutorial_wood.dialog.opt_ok,"{GOOD IDEA} Good advice, let's do this."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted.dialog.1,"Sir, we have encountered people willing to join us."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted.dialog.opt_ok,{ACCEPT} Send them in.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted.dialog.opt_notok,{DECLINE} Send them away.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted.dialog.opt_rob,{ROB THEM} Take away any weapons and supplies they have.
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1,"Hey, is anyone there? We're looking for help. We are tired of this endless wandering. We don't have much, but we can do a lot."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1_2,"He... Hello? If you listen to this, please answer. We can't make it on our own. We need someplace to go. Please, anybody..."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1_3,"Hey boss, we've heard you've got a nice Zone running there. We figured joining you is a better option than holding out on our own. What do you say?"
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1_4,"Hello? Infection Free Zone? We need provisions and accommodation. In exchange, we offer diligence and obedience."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1_5,"Hey! Hi! Hello! If you're listening, please answer. We're searching for a safe place to stay.  "
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1_6,Is anyone listening? We have a fair deal to offer. We'll work for food and protection. Answer if you're interested.
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1_7,"Um... hello? We were... Err... We are wondering if you need some people to join. You know, for work, patrols, or whatsoever. Let us know if you do."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1_8,"Is anybody there? Will you help us? We're starving, terrified and have nowhere to go. Please, don't leave us alone."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.1_9,"IFZ, IFZ, please respond. We've just left our shelter and we're looking for any organized group to join."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.accept,{INVITE} Please feel invited.
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.decline,"{DECLINE} Sorry, we can't accept you."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.thankyou,"Thanks, it means a lot to us. You can be sure that we will not be a burden."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.address,{ADDRESS} Where are you?
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.address1,We are at [[address-immigrants]]. Will you come for us?
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.come,{COME TO US} You must come on your own. Be careful. We're waiting for you.
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.stay,"{HIDE YOURSELF} Hide yourselves, we'll send somebody to pick you up."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.howmany,{HOW MANY} How many of you are there?
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.howmany2_4,Only a couple of people. Me and my close family.
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.howmany5_10,Several people. [[cacheImmigrantsCount]] to be precise.
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.howmany11_20,We survived in a small group. There are [[cacheImmigrantsCount]] of us.
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.howmany21_50,"If I count correctly, umm... [[cacheImmigrantsCount]] people."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.how_survive,{HOW SURVIVE?} How have you managed to survive so far?
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.how_survive1,"Umm.... we really don't know... Maybe a little smarts, maybe a little luck."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.ok,"OK, hope to see you soon."
dilemma_newpeople.dialog.switch,{SWITCH CHANNEL} ...
dilemma_first_child.dialog.1,"Chief, you won't guess what happened! The very first child has just been born in our Zone! As much as it fills people with hope and joy, it's also a huge responsibility. We need a place where our kids will grow and learn."
dilemma_first_child.dialog.opt_ok,{LET'S BUILD A KINDERGARTEN} We'll build a kindergarten. Let's raise kids the best we can.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.1,"Sir, we've bumped into a wandering group."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_2,"Chief, we've stumbled upon some people."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_3,"Boss, we've met some survivors."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_4,"Operator, we've come in contact with some people."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_5,"Sir, we have encountered a group of people."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_skills_1,They have some useful skills for squads.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_skills_2,"On top of that, some have skills that could come in handy."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_skills_3,"However, some of them have skills we could use."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_tech_1,They claim to have some technical and scientific knowledge.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_tech_2,"Additionally, some of them have technical and scientific knowledge."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_tech_3,"On the other hand, some of them are trained in science and technology."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_res_1,They have some resources.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_res_2,"Moreover, we can see them carrying some resources."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_res_3,They're carrying some resources though.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_guns_1,They've got some guns on them.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_guns_2,Another good thing is that they're well-armed.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_guns_3,"Some of them, however, are carrying guns."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_strong_1,They look strong and able.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_strong_2,"What's more, they seem to be strong and hard-working."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_strong_3,"The good thing about them though, is that they seem to know how to handle a weapon."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_weird_1,They're weird and aggressive.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_weird_2,"If that wasn't enough, they seem odd and aggresive."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_weird_3,They seem weird and aggressive though.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_ill_1,"They look sick, we can see some symptoms of the infection."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_ill_2,"Moreover, they're ill, probably infected by the virus."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_ill_3,"But the problem is they're ill, with signs of the infection."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_shot_1,They're badly wounded and need some help.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_shot_2,"What's more, some of them are injured."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_shot_3,"But the thing is, they're wounded and need medical assistance."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_wound_1,They've got some wounds from the infected.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_wound_2,"On top of that, some were wounded by the infected."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_wound_3,"What's bad though, is that they're wounded, probably by the infected."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_hungry_1,They look famished as if they haven't eaten for days.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_hungry_2,I'd also say they seem very hungry.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_hungry_3,"However, they haven't eaten for a few days."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.opt_ok,{ACCEPT} Ask them to join us.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.opt_notok,{DECLINE} Send them away.
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.opt_opinion,{WHAT DO YOU THINK?} What do you think? Should we accept them?
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.opi_pos_neg,"These people might be an asset, but it'll come with a price. As much as our zone will benefit from them, we can surely expect some issues if they join us."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.opi_pos_pos,"These people will surely fit in, we could use what they're offering. If I were you, I wouldn't think twice."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.opi_neg_neg,"These people spell trouble - they might be a burden to us, and it will take some time before accepting them pays off."
dilemma_immigrants_spotted_diverse_groups.dialog.opt_kill,"{KILL THEM} They pose too much risk, dispose of them."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.1,"We got an invitation from [[ZONE_NAME]], looking for a place to stay."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_2,Is this Infection Free Zone of [[STARTING_CITY]]? We'll work for food.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_3,"[[ZONE_NAME]], please respond. We're looking for any organized groups to join."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_4,"We've heard you've got a nice zone running there, and we'd be happy to join. What do you say?"
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_5,"[[ZONE_NAME]], are you receiving? We've heard your transmission and want to join up. "
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.intro_6,"[[ZONE_NAME]], are you receiving? We've heard you on the radio. We want to join. "
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.hello,{HELLO} This is the [[ZONE_NAME]]. We hear you loud and clear. 
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.about_pos,{WHAT CAN YOU OFFER?} How can you be useful to us?
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.about_neg,{WHAT BRINGS YOU?} What brings you to us? Is there something wrong with you?
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.accept,{INVITE} Please feel invited.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.decline,"{DECLINE} Sorry, we can't accept you."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_skills,There are a lot of things we can do if you send us scouting.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_tech,We've got some knowledge of tech and science.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_res,We're carrying some resources.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_guns,We're well-armed.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.pos_strong,We can handle heavy stuff and weapons easily.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_weird,"The past few years have been rough on us, we're on the edge. We need help."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_ill,We could use some medical treatment. Some of us are ill and require treatment. 
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_wound,Some of us are wounded and need to be patched up. We need medical help
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_wound_inf,The infected roughed us up pretty badly.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.neg_hungry,We haven't eaten in a few days.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.thankyou_1,"Thanks, we really needed a place to stay. We'll do our best to contribute to your Zone."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.thankyou_2,"That's great, many thanks."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.thankyou_3,"Thank you, we'll never forget that."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.decline_1,That's a bummer. We'll be on our way then.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.decline_2,Darn it! We've come here for nothing.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.decline_3,Hard luck. We'll look somewhere else.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.address,{}Where are you?
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.address1,We are near [[address-immigrants]]. Will you come for us?
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.come,"{COME ON YOUR OWN} You must come on your own, but you may meet our squads along the way. We're waiting for you."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.wait,"{WAIT THERE} Stay where you are, we'll send a squad to get you here safely."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.howmany,{HOW MANY} How many of you are there?
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.howmany2_4,Just my closest family. [[cacheImmigrantsCount]] to be precise.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.howmany5_10,Several people. [[cacheImmigrantsCount]] to be precise.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.howmany11_20,We survived in a small group. There are [[cacheImmigrantsCount]] of us.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.howmany21_50,There are quite a few... umm... [[cacheImmigrantsCount]] people.
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.ok_1,"OK, hope to see you soon."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.ok_2,"OK, we'll do that."
dilemma_newpeople_diverse_groups.dialog.ok_3,"Sure, that's what we'll do."
dilemma_laws_intro.dialog.1,"Chief, our settlement is growing, and so is our population. People say it's high time we introduced laws to face the upcoming threats. But first, we need a new place to gather and discuss those things."
dilemma_laws_intro.dialog.opt_ok,"{ALRIGHT} Alright, we'll do that."
dilemma_moveon.dialog.1,"Chief, our zone and the area around are secured. We're self-sustaining. It's time to establish new settlements elsewhere. We can pack up a bus with people and resources, gather our best squads and be on our way. What do you think?"
dilemma_moveon.dialog.opt_ok,"{PREPARE THE CONVOY} OK, let's prepare the convoy."
dilemma_moveon.dialog.opt_later,"{WE'RE NOT READY} Let's stay here for a little longer, I don't think we're ready."
dilemma_moveon.dialog.opt_no,"{WE'RE STAYING} No, we're not going anywhere. This zone is our home."
dilemma_clearmap.dialog.1,"Chief, there's still work to do here. There are some lairs of infected and raider hideouts around. We also need to stockpile resources for the zone. Let's clear the area and secure our settlement so that we can move on. "
dilemma_clearmap.dialog.opt_ok,"{LET'S DO THIS} Good advice, let's do this."
dilemma_firstswarm_start.dialog.1,"Chief, did you hear that? There must be hundreds of them! I have a bad feeling about this. "
dilemma_firstswarm_start.dialog.nope,"{NO, I DIDN'T} No, I didn't hear that."
dilemma_firstswarm_start.dialog.ok,"{GET READY!} OK, get ready to defend the zone. "
dilemma_firstswarm_start.dialog.nah,{THAT'S NOTHING} Don’t worry about that. Carry on with your duties.
dilemma_firstswarm_start.dialog.screaming,"The infected! They’re screaming, all around us. I can't see them, but they must be nearby."
dilemma_firstswarm_end.dialog.1,"Boss, it's been a rough night… Something must have made the infected extremely bloodthirsty. If more and more come, our chances will be really low."
dilemma_firstswarm_end.dialog.hope,{WE WILL SHOW THEM} Then we will take down as many as we can before we fall. 
dilemma_firstswarm_end.dialog.empathic,{WE WILL PREVAIL} We will get over this. We have to. We are all that's left of humanity.
dilemma_firstswarm_end.dialog.hide,"{WE WILL HIDE} In the worst-case scenario, we can still seal ourselves underground again. "
dilemma_unlock_dog_info.dialog.1,"Chief, we just found a dead animal… but the thing is, it was literally shred to pieces. It couldn't be just some ordinary infected. There are teeth marks on some of the skin, and it looks like dog teeth…"
dilemma_unlock_dog_info.dialog.ok,{OK} Stay alert.
dilemma_unlock_dog_spotted.dialog.1,Heads up! There are some infected dogs incoming fast! 
dilemma_unlock_dog_spotted.dialog.engage,{ENGAGE} Shoot them down!
dilemma_unlock_dog_spotted.dialog.run,"{RUN} Do not engage, run away!"
dilemma_swarm_incoming.dialog.1,"Sir, we found a trail nearby. It looked as if a huge swarm had run and trampled everything in their way, there must've been hundreds!"
dilemma_swarm_incoming.dialog.people,{HAVE YOU HEARD SOMETHING?} Have you heard anything?
dilemma_swarm_incoming.dialog.else,{ANYTHING ELSE?} Is there anything else?
dilemma_swarm_incoming.dialog.wail,Last night we could hear howls as if crowds of monsters were shouting and wailing. I think something really big is coming our way.
dilemma_swarm_incoming.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} Thanks for the update, we'll be ready."
dilemma_swarm_incoming.dialog.opt_investigate,"{TRACK THEM} Look for more signs, track them down."
dilemma_bear_hunt.dialog.1,"Chief, we have spotted the bear. It's way too close to the zone. This thing is enormous and obviously infected. It's not aware of our position and presence. We can end it here and now. "
dilemma_bear_hunt.dialog.opt_ok,{} Take it down immediately.
dilemma_bear_hunt.dialog.opt_notok,"{STAY BACK} Try not to engage, it's way too dangerous."
dilemma_moose_tracks.dialog.1,"Operator, our workers reported finding big hoofprints and animal waste nearby. I'd say we might have some moose around. Hard to say if it's one or more, there are no clear lines of tracks around."
dilemma_moose_tracks.dialog.opt_ok,"{TRACK IT DOWN} Try to find it, it's worth investigating."
dilemma_moose_tracks.dialog.opt_notok,"{IGNORE IT} It's just an animal, don't bother."
dilemma_enraged_moose.dialog.1,"Sir, we spotted an enormous enraged infected moose. It could be a huge threat to our vehicles and structures. We are watching it from a safe distance now. What should we do?"
dilemma_enraged_moose.dialog.opt_ok,{} Try to kill it.
dilemma_enraged_moose.dialog.opt_notok,"{STAY BACK} Leave it alone, it's not worth the risk."
dilemma_infected_bull.dialog.1,"Holy shit! Sir, there are some mad cattle here! These things seem unnaturally agitated and wander around, just like the infected. We should take the herd down before it gets to the zone!"
dilemma_infected_bull.dialog.opt_ok,"{LET IT BE} Try not to approach it, maybe it'll go away."
dilemma_infected_bull.dialog.opt_notok,"{WE'LL DEAL WITH THEM} We'll take them down, await my orders."
dilemma_bear_trackers.dialog.1,"Chief, we have spotted huge animal tracks nearby the zone. It must've been a bear. We shouldn't ignore such a threat. Should we track and put it down? "
dilemma_bear_trackers.dialog.opt_ok,"{TRACK IT DOWN} Yes, better not wait until it finds us."
dilemma_bear_trackers.dialog.opt_notok,"{LEAVE IT ALONE} This is too dangerous. Leave it alone, maybe it'll go away."
call_lair_intro.dialog.1,"Chief, this building is full of the infected! Looks like they made themselves some kind of a lair! If we want to clear it, we need good weapons, protective gear and a few squads at least!"
call_lair_intro.dialog.opt_prepare,{LET'S PREPARE} We'll gear up and clear this place out.
call_lair_intro.dialog.opt_leave,{LEAVE IT} Leave it for now. We don't have time and resources to clear it.
call_hallucination.dialog.1,"Hello, hello! Rise and shine!"
call_hallucination.dialog.reminder,"Gary? Come on, pick up the damn radio!"
call_hallucination.dialog.switch,{SWITCH CHANNEL} …
call_hallucination.dialog.switchdone,...
call_hallucination.dialog.2,"{RESPOND} This is the Operator of Infection Free Zone, state your business."
call_hallucination.dialog.finallyyly,Finally! I was beginning to wonder where you'd gone. Such a nice day outside… Got a good night's sleep. Think I'll go to that house by the end of the road today! It's time.
call_hallucination.dialog.wrongline,"{WRONG LINE} Sir, I think you've got me confused with someone else."
call_hallucination.dialog.whoareyou,"{WHO ARE YOU?} I'm sorry, who are you?"
call_hallucination.dialog.youknowme,"Ah, very funny, very funny… You almost had me. You know, I really appreciate our little talks."
call_hallucination.dialog.whattalks,{WHAT TALKS?} What talks?
call_hallucination.dialog.trytobereasonable,"{I DON’T KNOW YOU} Sir, I don't know you."
call_hallucination.dialog.ohne,"Then I… But we talked yesterday, and the day before… I know your voice, stop kidding around, Gary!"
call_hallucination.dialog.youredelu,{YOU'RE INSANE} You're acting insane.
call_hallucination.dialog.insaneme,I'm not insane! You're just like her! Just like her!
call_hallucination.dialog.youneedhelp,"{I'M SORRY. NOT GARY} I'm really sorry, sir, but I'm not Gary."
call_hallucination.dialog.buthowam,But-- I-- Then who... Who are you?
call_hallucination.dialog.sendasquad,{JOIN OUR ZONE} We have a zone set up here. I'm the chief. It's safe. You should join us.
call_hallucination.dialog.stayoff,"{STAY OFF THIS LINE} Just stay off this line, sir."
call_hallucination.dialog.laright,"So… you're really not him. I'm sorry, I get confused sometimes… I won't bother you again."
call_hallucination.dialog.joinusok,"Oh, I don't know… I haven't been out of the house in months."
call_hallucination.dialog.address,{ADDRESS} Where are you? What's the address?
call_hallucination.dialog.address2,[[ADDRESS-marker_hallucinated]]
call_hallucination.dialog.sendingasquad,"{SENDING A SQUAD} We're sending a squad to your location. You can trust us, sir. We will help you."
call_hallucination.dialog.okcool,All right… OK. It will be nice to see you again! Thank you.
call_hallucination.dialog.onsecond,"{CANCEL INVITATION} On second thought, we've got enough men as it is."
call_hallucination.dialog.ohok,"That's all right. I'm good here. Well then… Take care now, Gary!"
dilemma_hallucination_end.dialog.1,"Boss. We found the guy, but he's weird. Are you sure we want him? Our citizens might get a bit concerned…"
dilemma_hallucination_end.dialog.2,{ACCEPT HIM} Take him. Every life matters.
dilemma_hallucination_end.dialog.3,{LEAVE HIM} Leave him where he is.
call_psycho_caller.dialog.1,Ha ha ha… This is over.
call_psycho_caller.dialog.reminder,You've all lost your minds…
call_psycho_caller.dialog.listen,{LISTEN} …
call_psycho_caller.dialog.anyone,{ANYONE THERE?} Hello? Is there anyone there?
call_psycho_caller.dialog.idiots,"Disgusting, lousy, pathetic!"
call_psycho_caller.dialog.whoareyou,{WHO ARE YOU?} Who are you? 
call_psycho_caller.dialog.whatdoyouwant,{WHAT DO YOU WANT?} What do you want? 
call_psycho_caller.dialog.morons,Don't you realize?! You're all gonna die! We're all gonna die! Ha ha ha!
call_psycho_caller.dialog.takeiteasy,"{TAKE IT EASY} Hey, take it easy."
call_psycho_caller.dialog.takeiteasy2,Take it easy?! Do you people understand nothing?!
call_psycho_caller.dialog.youok,{ARE YOU OK?} Are you OK?!
call_psycho_caller.dialog.youok2,"OK?! No one's OK! The end is near! It's right there, right in front of us!"
call_psycho_caller.dialog.listen2,{LISTEN} …
call_psycho_caller.dialog.werenot,"{CALM DOWN, SIR} Calm down, sir."
call_psycho_caller.dialog.youresick,{YOU'RE SICK} You're sick.
call_psycho_caller.dialog.endti,This is the end times! Don't you see?!
call_psycho_caller.dialog.hope,{THERE'S STILL HOPE} You're wrong. There's still hope.
call_psycho_caller.dialog.getoffline,{GET OFF OUR COMMS} Get off our comms.
call_psycho_caller.dialog.whathope,"Hope? There's no hope! There's hell on earth, and we're living in it!"
call_psycho_caller.dialog.truth,"Truth hurts, doesn't it?! Oh, I bet it does! Wake up! This is it!"
call_psycho_caller.dialog.wehavetotry,{WE CAN'T GIVE UP} We can't give up.
call_psycho_caller.dialog.nochoice,{NO OTHER CHOICE} There's no other choice.
call_psycho_caller.dialog.disconnect,{SWITCH CHANNEL} ...
call_psycho_caller.dialog.disconnected,…
call_psycho_caller.dialog.diedie,We're all gonna die! We're all gonna die! We're all gonna die!
call_last_transmission.dialog.1,This is the chief operator of the Safe Zone. We're under attack. I repeat. We're under attack-- *kshh*
call_last_transmission.dialog.reminder,…
call_last_transmission.dialog.reminder2,…
call_last_transmission.dialog.hello,"{WE CAN HEAR YOU} This is the Infection Free Zone chief Operator, we copy you. Go ahead."
