call_last_transmission.dialog.nextpart,*kshh* --and we can't hold them off much longer. This is the mo-*kshh*
call_last_transmission.dialog.canyouhear,{CAN YOU HEAR ME?} Can you hear me? Over.
call_last_transmission.dialog.werelosing,{WE'RE LOSING YOU} We're losing you. Over.
call_last_transmission.dialog.not,*kshh* --knew this was gonna happen. But now we're ready more than eve-*kshh*
