call_last_transmission.dialog.sir,{SIR!} Sir!
call_last_transmission.dialog.ourpepo,*kshh* --to our people. And that moment will define us forever. If anyone can hear us… Please. We need you.
call_last_transmission.dialog.wecan,{WE CAN SEND HELP} We can send help. Over.
call_last_transmission.dialog.listen,{LISTEN} …
call_last_transmission.dialog.onouwn,*Sigh* We're on our own… But we're strong. Our hearts go out to the brave ones taking a stand against the infected.
call_last_transmission.dialog.hello_second,{HELLO?} Hello?
call_last_transmission.dialog.listen2,{LISTEN} …
call_last_transmission.dialog.disconnect,{SWITCH CHANNEL} …
