call_last_transmission.dialog.death,"If anyone can hear us, stay strong! We can still rebuild! We can survive!..... *kshh*  Aaaaaahhh!"
dilemma_last_transmission_start.dialog.1,"Sir, the signal is very weak, but it must be originating from some nearby location. If we search the nearby areas by checking the signal strength, we might locate its origin."
dilemma_last_transmission_start.dialog.2,{LET'S FIND THEM!} Let's find them as soon as possible!
dilemma_last_transmission_end.dialog.1,"Sir, we found where the transmission was coming from. This must have been one of the safe zones… It seems it fell years ago, but the equipment somehow survived and kept transmitting. It is powered by solar panels that were occasionally catching light. Maybe we could try to use solar energy, too?"
dilemma_last_transmission_end.dialog.2,{OK} All right. Let's try.
dilemma_last_transmission_weak_signal.dialog.1,"The signal is weaker over here. Let's search elsewhere, quickly."
dilemma_last_transmission_weak_signal.dialog.alt_1,"It's not here, we have to keep looking."
dilemma_last_transmission_weak_signal.dialog.2,"{PRESS ON} Keep going, we have to find them."
dilemma_last_transmission_strong_signal.dialog.1,"The signal is slightly stronger over here. If we search the nearby buildings, we might find the source of the transmission!"
dilemma_last_transmission_strong_signal.dialog.2,"{FIND THEM} Understood. Find them, but be careful. The place sounded like it was overrun."
