call_sick_survivor.dialog.1,*ksch* *ksch* Hello? Does anybody hear me?
call_sick_survivor.dialog.reminder,...hello? 
call_sick_survivor.dialog.ihearyou,{I HEAR YOU} I hear you. This is the Infection Free Zone. 
call_sick_survivor.dialog.thankgod,Thank god... I've lost all hope... I need help ... I'm sick...
call_sick_survivor.dialog.whathelp,{WHAT HELP?} What help do you need?
call_sick_survivor.dialog.symptoms,{YOUR SYMPTOMS?} What are your symptoms?
call_sick_survivor.dialog.bitten,{WERE YOU BITTEN?} Have you been bitten or scratched by an infected?
call_sick_survivor.dialog.anymedics,{MEDICATIONS?} Do you need any medications?
call_sick_survivor.dialog.whatever,I need- *bursts into cough*
call_sick_survivor.dialog.symptoms2,"I have a fever, cough and chills... had to *cough* catch a cold after the last downpour. I need a doctor... "
call_sick_survivor.dialog.redeyes,{RED EYES?} Are your eyes red? 
call_sick_survivor.dialog.redeyes2,"No, certainly not. My eyes are fine. As always."
call_sick_survivor.dialog.bitten2,"No contact with them. Even if, I've lived for years, I am immune to the Mad Virus!"
call_sick_survivor.dialog.anymedics2,"Yes, for sure... I don't have any. I will repay what I have."
call_sick_survivor.dialog.whathave,{WHAT DO YOU HAVE?} What do you have then?
call_sick_survivor.dialog.supplies,"I have food, a lot of it. I've been stacking it *cough* since the beginning. Canned meat, soups, you name it. I also got some ammo and a gun or two."
call_sick_survivor.dialog.canyoubring,{CAN YOU COME?} Can you come to us by yourself?
call_sick_survivor.dialog.cantwalk,"No, I can barely walk, I'd need somebody to come and help me."
call_sick_survivor.dialog.wecome,"{WHERE ARE YOU?} Please, state your location."
call_sick_survivor.dialog.collect,I'm staying at [[ADDRESS-marker_event_sick_survivor]] .
call_sick_survivor.dialog.sendhelp,"{WE'LL HELP} Okay, I'll send a squad to you as soon as I can. "
call_sick_survivor.dialog.nohelp,"{WE CAN'T HELP} I'm sorry, but you're on your own. We can't help you. "
call_sick_survivor.dialog.manythanks,"Many thanks, you're a lifesaver."
call_sick_survivor.dialog.dontleaveme,"No! Don't leave me alone, please! I'm done without help! I'll give you any- *coughs violently*"
dilemma_sick_survivor_found.dialog.1,"Sir, we reached the survivor... It was too late for him. He attacked us just as we entered the room."
dilemma_sick_survivor_found.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} That's too bad, thanks for the report."
dilemma_jackpot.dialog.1,"Chief, we've just found a shit load of supplies! Some prepper must've lived here, and they piled up enough to survive the apocalypse. God bless these preppers!"
dilemma_jackpot.dialog.opt_ok,"{THAT'S GREAT!} That's great news, take it all!"
dilemma_skyscraper.dialog.1,"Boss, do you know that tall building at [[ADDRESS-marker_event_skyscraper]]? If we get there, we could see much further into the local area. There's probably a lot of resources there as well."
dilemma_skyscraper.dialog.opt_ok,{GOOD IDEA} It's a great idea. Let's check it out now.
dilemma_skyscraper.dialog.opt_later,{LATER} We will check it out later.
dilemma_graveyard.dialog.1,"Sir, we've entered a graveyard... It's so eerie here. So many graves are smashed and mangled for some reason, as if somebody was digging with their hands... Could the infected have done this? Or maybe something tried to dig it's way out from the inside?"
dilemma_graveyard.dialog.opt_ok,{ZOMBIES DON'T EXIST} Zombies don't exist. Only the living infected pose a threat. Keep scavenging.
dilemma_graveyard.dialog.opt_notok,"{JUST GET OUT} I don't know, but better keep out of those places."
dilemma_abandoned_airport.dialog.1,"Chief, we're at the old airport, and this place is... morbid. All these bones, body parts, shreds of clothing, both adults' and children's, everywhere... People must've been trying to escape, and finally ran out of luck. Terribly so."
dilemma_abandoned_airport.dialog.opt_ok,"{SEARCH THE PLACE} A lot of people died, that's right, but we need to focus on the living. Search the place."
dilemma_abandoned_airport.dialog.opt_notok,"{PAY RESPECTS AND SEARCH} Have a minute of silence there, people. And see if there's anything left."
dilemma_lore_atomic_bomb.dialog.1,"Boss... this place that we've reached... everything is wiped out. The trees are down, the buildings... all gone... It's awful. This must have been some kind of a nuclear strike years ago. The army must've been truly desperate to clear the infected back in the day..."
dilemma_lore_atomic_bomb.dialog.opt_ok,"{GO THROUGH} Just go through, it should be safe."
dilemma_lore_atomic_bomb.dialog.opt_notok,"{LEAVE THIS PLACE} It doesn't sound safe, leave this area."
dilemma_heroic.dialog.1,"Chief, there are too many of them! We won't make it, goddamit!"
dilemma_heroic.dialog.reminder,You can't do this alone!
dilemma_heroic.dialog.reminder2,We need backup! Now!
dilemma_heroic.dialog.save,Save yourselves! I'll hold them off! Run!
dilemma_heroic.dialog.save2,No! We're not leaving you behind!
dilemma_heroic.dialog.opt_ok,{RUN!} Run!
dilemma_heroic.dialog.opt_notok,"{SAVE HIM!} Save him, fight!"
dilemma_funeral_wake.dialog.1,"We have lost some people, close and dear. We want to mourn them and give a proper burial. We cannot do this at night, so we should give our workers and squads some time off. Let us have a moment to pay our respects."
dilemma_funeral_wake.dialog.opt_ok,"{PAY RESPECTS} Alright, let's honor the fallen. "
dilemma_funeral_wake.dialog.opt_notok,{FOCUS ON THE LIVING} We have no time to mourn. There's a lot of work to do to survive.
dilemma_funeral_wake.dialog.thankyou,"Thank you, it means a lot to all of us."
dilemma_funeral_wake.dialog.heartless,I... I can't believe how you can be so heartless. People will remember that.
dilemma_morale_high.dialog.1,"Chief, it makes me so proud to say that we've created a safe and prosperous place to live. Even if not everything is perfect, it fills everybody with hope that we may live normally one day. I think we should gather all our people together and rejoice!"
dilemma_morale_high.dialog.opt_ok,"{LET'S CELEBRATE} You're right, let's throw a big one for the people!"
dilemma_morale_high.dialog.opt_notok,"{CARRY ON WITH WORK} We can't just rest on our laurels, there's work to do. "
dilemma_morale_low.dialog.1,"Operator, the moods in our Zone are terrible. People are on the edge, and if we don't do anything, they will start leaving soon. "
dilemma_morale_low.dialog.opt_ok,{I'LL DO WHAT I CAN} We'll do whatever it takes to keep people here.
dilemma_morale_low.dialog.opt_notok,"{DON'T DO ANYTHING} We'll be fine, people always complain."
dilemma_searching_rubble.dialog.1,"Operator, our workers found a weird metal chest while removing the rubble. They have no idea what might be inside, should we open it?"
dilemma_searching_rubble.dialog.opt_ok,"{OPEN IT} Sure, let's see what's inside."
dilemma_searching_rubble.dialog.opt_notok,"{DON'T OPEN IT} Leave it, it might be dangerous."
dilemma_searching_rubble.dialog.goodstuff,OH. MY. GOD. You'll love this. The chest is full of ammo. That will come in handy!
dilemma_basement.dialog.1,"Sir, we're in a building full of the infected, and they've cut off our escape. We've barricaded ourselves in the basement, but we can't get out now. Can you send a squad to fight them off and help us?"
dilemma_basement.dialog.opt_ok,"{WAIT FOR HELP} Wait there, I'll send a squad immediately."
dilemma_basement.dialog.opt_notok,{FIGHT THEM YOURSELVES} What? You are the squad that is supposed to fight the infected.
dilemma_basement.dialog.alot,"But chief, there's a lot of them here! We don't stand a chance. "
dilemma_basement.dialog.opt_okk,"{OK THEN} Alright then, if the situation is that hard, I'll send somebody."
dilemma_basement.dialog.opt_fight,{FIGHT YOURSELVES} Fight your way out. That's your job.
call_morsecode.dialog.1,• • • - - - • • •       • • • - - - • • • 
call_morsecode.dialog.reminder,• • • - - - • • •       • • • - - - • • • 
call_morsecode.dialog.oneforyes,{SEND SHORT FOR YES} Send a short signal for yes or long for no.
call_morsecode.dialog.sos,• • • - - - • • •
call_morsecode.dialog.hear_yes,•        •
call_morsecode.dialog.location,{LOCATION} Can you tell your location?
call_morsecode.dialog.location_no,-
call_morsecode.dialog.danger,{DANGER?} Are you in danger?
call_morsecode.dialog.danger_yes,•       •      • 
call_morsecode.dialog.danger_infected,.. -. ..-. . -.-. - . -..
call_morsecode.dialog.searching,{WE WILL FIND YOU} We will try to find you. Just hold on.
call_morsecode.dialog.canthelp,"{CAN'T HELP} I'm sorry, we can't help you. We don't know where you are."
call_morsecode.dialog.sos_end,• • • - - - • • •
dilemma_morsecode_found.dialog.1,"Operator, we found him holed up in a building full of old military equipment. There were a few infected around. It's a miracle he could contact us at all. There are also some old technical books. They might be useful."
dilemma_morsecode_found.dialog.opt_ok,{SEND HIM} Send him our way and gather the books.
dilemma_morsecode_found.dialog.opt_notok,"{LEAVE HIM} Leave him there, but take the books."
dilemma_broadcast_warning.dialog.1,"Operator, maybe we should be more careful with our broadcasts? We might draw in more raiders than people willing to join."
dilemma_broadcast_warning.dialog.cautious,"{LET'S BE CAUTIOUS} You're right, we shouldn't do it so often."
dilemma_broadcast_warning.dialog.ignore,"{IGNORE IT} Even if, raiders are no match for us anyway, we should keep broadcasting."
dilemma_train.dialog.1,"Boss, this derailed train... it's full of dead people in awful positions. There must have been an outbreak during the evacuation, while the train was still moving... We can dismantle it for parts and look for anything of use, but honestly - I'd prefer to leave this place."
dilemma_train.dialog.opt_ok,{LEAVE IT} Leave it as it is for now
dilemma_train.dialog.opt_need,{WE NEED IT} We have to take it apart. 
dilemma_original.dialog.1,"Chief, we know you are using a pirated copy of IFZ. Times are hard, but the developers have to make some money to constantly develop the game. Mind that crackers most likely exploit your computer. Please consider buying an original copy."
dilemma_original.dialog.opt_ok,"{}Ok, I'll do this."
dilemma_original.dialog.opt_later,{}Maybe one day.
dilemma_original.dialog.opt_notok,{}No way.
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.1,"To anyone out here, I've got some stuff to trade and will be around for a while, answer if you're interested."
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.1alt,"Hi Operator, I'm in the area. Want to trade?"
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.1alt2,"[[ZONE_NAME]], traveling trader here. You need anything?"
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.reminder,Anybody there?
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.reminder2,Helooo? Got stuff to trade.
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_ok,{BRING WHAT YOU'VE GOT} Just bring whatever you've got.
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_show,{}Show me what you've got
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_ok_2,I'm on my way then. See you soon!
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_what,{} What do you have?
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_what_2,What do you need?
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_fnf,{} Food and other basics
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.exact1,What exactly?
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_food,{} Food
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_fuel,{} Fuel
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_const,{} Construction materials
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.exact_const,That is?
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_wood,{} Wood
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_metal,{} Metal
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_bricks,{} Bricks
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_bnm,{} Books and meds
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.exact2,What exactly?
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_books,"{TECH BOOKS} Technical books, for research."
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_medi,{} Medicines
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.gotit,"Sure, I've got some. Need anything else?"
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.nocando,"Sorry, no can do, I got nothing."
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_gna,{} Guns and ammo
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.exact3,And specifically?
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_guns,{} Guns
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.buy_ammo,{} Ammo
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_thennothing,{NOTHING} I have no other needs.
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_notok,{DON'T NEED ANYTHING} We've got all we need.
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_notok_2,"No business? Fine, maybe you'll need something some other time."
dilemma_wandering_merchant.dialog.opt_deal,"Alright then, let's get on with that. See you at the gates."
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.1,"[[ZONE_NAME]] are you there? I'm in danger, please help! "
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.reminder,"Need help, now!"
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.reminder2,I can't hold them off!
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.opt_who,{} Who is attacking you?
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.opt_who_inf,Infected! Loads of them!
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.opt_who_raider,Raiders! They are armed!
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.opt_location,{} State your location
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.opt_location_2,I'm at [[ADDRESS-marker_mission_wandering_merchant_attacked]]
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attacked.dialog.come,{} We're coming.
dilemma_wandering_merchant_squad.dialog.1,"Sir, we met the traveling trader. He's got a vehicle bursting with stuff. What should we tell him?"
dilemma_wandering_merchant_squad.dialog.opt_zone,"{SEND TO THE ZONE} Send him here, we'll see what he's got."
dilemma_wandering_merchant_squad.dialog.opt_there,{TRADE THERE} Trade with what you've got.
dilemma_wandering_merchant_squad.dialog.opt_rob,{ROB HIM} Kill the man and take the stuff. We'll put it to better use.
dilemma_wandering_merchant_squad.dialog.opt_notok,{} Send him away.
dilemma_wandering_merchant_atgate.dialog.1,"Chief, the merchant has just come to the zone and wants to trade with us."
dilemma_wandering_merchant_atgate.dialog.opt_ok,{} Let's trade then
dilemma_wandering_merchant_atgate.dialog.opt_notok,{} Send him away
dilemma_wandering_merchant_atgate.dialog.opt_attack,{} Attack him
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attack_followup.dialog.1,"Thanks for saving me out there, I wouldn't have made it without your help."
dilemma_wandering_merchant_attack_followup.dialog.opt_ok,{NO PROBLEM} No worries. Stay away from trouble in the future.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.1,"Chief, we are scavenging this place but there is something odd about it... someone must have been here recently...."
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.2,"Get on the ground! Drop your weapons, hands where I can see them!"
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.whathap,{WHAT'S GOING ON?!} What's going on?!
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.hey,{WHO IS THIS?!} Who is this?!
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.thisisokup,"Nice little squad you got here. Very, very nice."
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.whoareee,{WHO ARE YOU?} Who are you?
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.whoareee2,"Oh, you know. Just a humble man, earning his living on the road."
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.whatdoyouwant,{WHAT DO YOU WANT?} What do you want?
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.whatdoyouwant2,I don't know. What can you offer for your people's lives?
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.howmany,{HOW BIG IS YOUR GROUP?} How big is your group?
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.howmany2,Why'd you expect me to tell you that? I'm not stupid.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.leader,{GIVE ME THE LEADER} I want to speak to the leader.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.leader2,Then you're in luck! This would be me.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.justsaywhat,{JUST SAY WHAT YOU WANT} Just tell me what you want.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.justsaywhat2,"Hmmm, let's see. Canned food! Shitload of cans full of delicious stuff. God, I'd kill for a chicken soup. Oh, wait... ha ha ha."
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.justdont,"{PLEASE, DON'T HURT ANYONE} Don't hurt anyone. Please."
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.bastard,{YOU BASTARD} You bastard.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.bastard2,Come on. Let's be nice to each other. You don't want me gettin' angry.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.releasethem,{RELEASE THEM} Release them!
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.orelse,Or else what?
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.youllregretthis,{YOU'RE GONNA PAY} You're gonna pay for this...
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.pay,Pay? How?
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.killyou,{WE'LL KILL YOU} We'll kill you.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.retaliate,{WE'LL RETALIATE} We'll retaliate.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.reasonable,"Now, now. Let's be reasonable. Consider what I'm about to say. You ready?"
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.fuyou,{JUST SAY IT} Just say it already.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.silent,{...} ...
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.thisisiit,"This is how it's gonna go. You're coming here with supplies, and quick. You take too long? Your people die. You bring any weapons? Poof! They're dead. Soo... yeah. That's about it."
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.willyouletthemgo,{WILL YOU LET THEM GO?} We do this... and you let my people go?
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.no,{I DON'T THINK SO} I don't think so.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.yehyeh,"Yeah, yeah. A deal's a deal."
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.besmart,Come on. Be smart about this... I'm not kidding around.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.fine,{ACCEPT} Alright... we'll be there. We'll bring what we can.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.nofinal,{REFUSE} No. I don't like doing this... but no. We're not gonna be blackmailed.
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.coolgreat,I'm glad we have an understanding. Later!
call_bandit_ransom.dialog.fiiine,Fine! But remember. This is on you.... execute them! *gunshots*
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.1,"Woah, I see that somebody doesn't like playing by the rules. I told you to come with supplies, not guns."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.release,"{RELEASE THEM} Release my people now, and nobody will get hurt."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.bargain,"{MAKE A DEAL} We have come here to strike a bargain, and brought a little guarantee of safety."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.alright,"Alright, alright. So how you wanna play it?"
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.letthemgo,"{LET THEM GO} You let my people go, and we don't kill yours."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.themfirst,"{RELEASE THEM FIRST} First, you release the captives, then we'll talk."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.exchange,"{EXCHANGE} We'll give you what we've got, and you give us our people back."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.idontthinkso,"That's not what we agreed, Operator mate. You'll give us what we want or your people will sing hallelujah in heaven today."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.cool,{TAKE WHAT WE HAVE} Let it be then. Let's exchange.
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.notcool,{RELEASE MY SQUAD} You've heard our offer. It's final. 
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.soisours,So is ours. Give us stuff or they're done. 
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.nah,{NO} That's not going to happen.
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.lastchance,"Ok mate, last chance. I'm counting to three and you either give us what we want, or your guys bite the dust. One..."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.wait,{WAIT} ...
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.two,Two...
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.waitmore,{WAIT} ...
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.three,Three...
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.keepwaiting,{WAIT} ...
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.ballsofsteel,"Goddammit Operator mate, you've got balls of steel. Nobody wants to die today. Take your people and off with you. You earned it."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.thatworks,"Alrighty, let's do this then. Take your guys and get out of my sight. Until next time."
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.die,{FIGHT} You've made your choice already. We'll just do the world a favor.
call_bandit_ransom_weapons.dialog.bastard,"Goddamit, they fooled us! Kill'em boys! I'll get you next time, Operator!"
call_bandit_ransom_noweapons.dialog.1,"You moron, I can't believe you fell for that! We'll keep your people under our wings, nice and safe. "
call_bandit_ransom_noweapons.dialog.letthemgo,"{LET THEM GO} We kept our end of the bargain, keep yours and let my people go."
call_bandit_ransom_noweapons.dialog.whatyoumean,{WHAT DO YOU MEAN?} What do you mean by that?
call_bandit_ransom_noweapons.dialog.fooled,{YOU FOOLED US} You fooled us!
call_bandit_ransom_noweapons.dialog.funny,"Well, I think your people will now have friends to play with. We'll keep them for now."
call_bandit_ransom_noweapons.dialog.releasethem,"{RELEASE THEM} Release my people immediately, or there will be consequences!"
call_bandit_ransom_noweapons.dialog.youlldie,"{WE'LL GET YOU} We'll get you for that, rest assured."
call_bandit_ransom_noweapons.dialog.sure,Want them back? Let's double the price. Come and get them.
dilemma_bandit_ransom_reminder.dialog.1,"Heeeeeyyyy Operator mate, we still got your guys, you forgot already? Would be a terrible shame if something happened to them, wouldn't it?"
dilemma_bandit_ransom_reminder.dialog.opt_ok,{WE'LL BE THERE} We'll send our men soon.
dilemma_bandit_ransom_reminder.dialog.opt_notok,{WE'RE NOT COMING} We won't negotiate with the likes of you.
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.1,"Time's up Operator mate, we're not going to feed your people anymore. Say goodbye to your little birds."
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.opt_ok,{IT'S NOTHING} It won't affect us.
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.opt_notok,{LET'S TALK} Wait! We can still negotiate.
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.toolate,It's way too late for that.
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.anything,{WE'LL GIVE ANYTHING} We'll give you anything you want.
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.ohwell,{SO BE IT} If it can't be helped...
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.double,"When you put it like this... Alrighty, I'll give you two more days but you'll have to double the supplies we wanted."
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.welldo,{OK} We'll do that.
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.noway,"{NOT OK} No way, that's too much!"
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.great,"That's great, don't be late this time!"
dilemma_bandit_ransom_timeout.dialog.gunshot,It's on you Operator mate. *gunshots*
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.1,"Chief, we've just encountered some wounded people. They claim to have been attacked by some armed men, and escaped afterwards."
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.opt_ok,{ACCEPT} Send them in.
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.opt_notok,{DECLINE} Send them away.
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.wherewasit,{WHERE WAS IT?} Where were they attacked?
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.atdahood,It was at [[ADDRESS-marker_event_bandit_found_hideout]]. The men who attacked them jumped from the house there.
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.opt_questions,{MORE QUESTIONS} We need to know more about them first.
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.what,What should I ask them?
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.whathappened,{WHAT HAPPENED?} What happened to them?
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.whoattacked,{WHO HURT THEM?} Who did it to them?
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.armrob,They were attacked and robbed. Beaten as well.
dilemma_bandit_victims.dialog.whodidit,"Some armed men, probably a bandit group."
dilemma_bandit_dead_bandits.dialog.1,"Chief... we found a few bodies, must have been the raiders. The infected got them, but they left some guns and ammo."
dilemma_bandit_dead_bandits.dialog.opt_ok,{WE'RE IN LUCK} Lucky us.
dilemma_bandit_dead_bandits.dialog.opt_notok,{THEY HAD IT COMING} They've got what they deserved.
call_bandit_listen.dialog.1,"Hi there mate! Your frequencies aren't quite secure, did you know that? I've been listening to you for a while. And I'm taking notes. Very. Detailed. Notes. "
call_bandit_listen.dialog.stop,{STOP DOING THAT!} Stop doing that. Immediately.
call_bandit_listen.dialog.nomatter,{IT DOESN'T MATTER} Keep going. You're not nearly competent enough to make any use of them.
call_bandit_listen.dialog.funny,"Ha ha! You're a funny guy Operator, anybody told you that yet?"
call_bandit_respect.dialog.1,"Well Operator, you've got us out after all. I can't believe you did that. But you did. I should've given you my respect much earlier. You're the bigger man, no doubt. What will you do with us now, huh?"
call_bandit_respect.dialog.fight,{JOIN US} You'll fight for us.
call_bandit_respect.dialog.free,{YOU'RE FREE TO GO} You're free to go.
call_bandit_respect.dialog.itwilldo,"That's better than dying I guess. Thanks, we'll try not to screw anything up."
call_bandit_respect.dialog.freedom,"What? You're letting us go? Seriously, after all that happened?"
call_bandit_respect.dialog.youoweme,"{YOU OWE ME} Yes, but you owe me a big one. And you'll pay dearly if I ever hear that you're up to no good."
call_bandit_respect.dialog.ishouldnt,"{YOU'LL STAY} You're right, I'd better keep an eye on you."
call_bandit_respect.dialog.calloff,"I'll call off all my boys, whoever is left out there. I won't forget what you did for us."
call_bandit_respect.dialog.whatwedo,What would you make us do then?
call_bandit_respect.dialog.welcome,{WELCOME} Welcome to the Zone.
call_bandit_respect.dialog.farewell, Farewell boss!
dilemma_bandit_no_more_trouble.dialog.1,"Chief, we've found them. They've ended up like all the others, shredded to pieces. One of them was sitting against the wall holding a radio. He must've shot himself before the infected got him."
dilemma_bandit_no_more_trouble.dialog.opt_ok,{IT'S OVER NOW} Let's hope there will be no more trouble.
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.1,"Operator, we found the raiders' hideout. They haven't spotted us yet and it looks like a perfect opportunity to attack. Should we engage?"
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.opt_ok,{ENGAGE} Let's show them
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.opt_info,{MORE INFORMATION} Let's find out more first.
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.opt_notok,{LET THEM BE} Leave them be
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.sure,What information do you need?
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.howmany,{HOW MANY?} How many of them are there?
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.howarmed,{ARE THEY ARMED?} What kind of weapons do they have?
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.whattheydo,{THEIR ACTIVITY} What are they doing?
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.several,"From what we can see, I'd say about a dozen."
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.automatic,"The usual. Some pistols, a few rifles."
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.patrols,Most of them don't do anything. Some raiders are looking out through windows.
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.iknow,{ENOUGH INFO} That's enough information. 
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.whatwedo,What shall we do then?
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.backup,"{WAIT FOR BACKUP} You need more guns, we'll get you some backup."
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.waiting,"{WAIT UNTIL NIGHT} Wait until it gets dark, we'll take them by surprise."
dilemma_bandit_found_hideout.dialog.roger,Roger that Sir.
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.1,"Hi there Operator, how you doin' mate? I know how it sounds, and we did you some wrong, but I've got nobody else to call. And shit hit the fan."
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.reminder,You there Op? 
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.reminder2,"Pick up, goddammit!"
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.whatisit,{WHAT DO YOU WANT?} What do you want?
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.whathap,{WHAT'S HAPPENING THERE?} What in the hell is happening there?
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.hitthefan,"Well, to put it lightly... We're surrounded at [[ADDRESS-marker_event_bandit_attacked]]. These infected jackshits are already inside and we're stuck in the last room, won't hold out for long. And none of my boys can come to help, sooooo..."
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.yomad,{YOU'RE MAD} You're out of your mind if you think that we'll help you.
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.diehard,{DIE HARD} I hope they don't go easy on you.
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.whyhelp,{WHY SHOULD WE HELP?} Why should we help you?
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.comeon,"Come on Operator mate, I know I wasn't the best of friends, but I'll make it up for you, scout's honor! "
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.desperate,"We'll do anything! Really, whatever you want, your call."
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.disarm,{DISARM AND JOIN} Surrender your weapons and join us.
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.stopattacks,"{STOP YOUR ATTACKS} Stop attacking people, us included."
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.justdie,{JUST DIE} I'd ask you to die then.
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.howtolive,But how are we supposed to live then?
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.cantrefuse,{YOU CAN'T REFUSE} You're in no position to refuse.
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.youshouldnt,"{YOU SHOULDN'T LIVE} You're right, maybe you're better off dead."
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.igetit,"Ok, I get it, no more trouble then."
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.okokok,"Alright, alright, We'll do anything! Just get us out of here!"
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.werecoming,{WE'RE COMING} We're coming to get you out.
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.forgetit,"{FORGET IT} On second thought, you're not worth it. Suffer like all of your victims."
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.switch,{SWITCH CHANNEL} ...
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.manythanks,Thanks mate! Just make haste goddammit!
call_bandit_attacked.dialog.figured,God fu***ng dammit! Figured you won't help us. See you in hell!
call_bandit_dead_people.dialog.1,"Ooooh, I found some of your birdies dead on the ground. Such a waste. What happened to them? Did somebody cut their wings?"
call_bandit_dead_people.dialog.notyour,{NOT YOUR PROBLEM} That's none of your concern.
call_bandit_dead_people.dialog.theydied,"{THEY JUST DIED} They died, that's it."
call_bandit_dead_people.dialog.notcool,"Not cool, not cool. I'd put these people to better use. And keep them alive."
call_bandit_aftermath.dialog.1,"Your guys are pretty tough, goddammit. I thought my men would make short work of you. I lost them."
call_bandit_aftermath.dialog.yomad,{DON'T MESS WITH US} That's what you get for messing with us.
call_bandit_aftermath.dialog.hell,{WE BEAT YOU} We gave you hell.
call_bandit_aftermath.dialog.therisk,"The risk I took was calculated, but man, am I bad at math?"
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.1,*digital noises*
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.signal,*the noises continue*
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.heloooo,"{HELLOOOO} Hellooooo, are you there?"
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.signal2,*the noises continue*
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.switch,{SWITCH CHANNEL}...
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.switchdone,*the noises fade away*
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.squad_wait,"Chief, I think I know what it was - it was the sound of a frequency-hopping radio. Coded message, military grade. We won't be able to decode that. I think we should wait until they try to contact us directly."
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.opt_okk,"{OK} Ok, let's wait then."
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.squad_sayhello,"Chief, I think I know what it was - it was the sound of a frequency-hopping radio. Coded message, military grade. We won't be able to decode that, but we could just call-out and say hello? "
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.hello,"{HELLO} Hello, is anybody there?"
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.opt_no,"{WE WON'T} We'd better not, we don't know who's on the other side."
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.signal3,*the noises continue*
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.signal4,*the noises continue*
call_bgmilitary_03_coded_transmission.dialog.switch2,{SWITCH CHANNEL}...
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.1,This is Major Nowak of the Survivors' Army speaking. Respond. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.reminder,We know you’re out there. Respond or there will be consequences. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.reminder2,"Answer immediately, this is an order. Over."
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.2,"{RESPOND} This is chief Operator of Infection Free Zone, we hear you loud and clear. Over."
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.3,"Listen, we know you’ve got a community out there. We have the same goal. We’re what’s left of the civilised world… For now. Over."
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.switch,{SWITCH CHANNEL} ...
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.switchdone,...
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.findus,{HOW DID YOU FIND US?} How did you find us? Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.findus2,We've been listening to your comms for a while now. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.whoareyou,{WHO ARE YOU?} Who are you? Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.whoareyou2,We're the last remaining government unit in this twisted world. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.trust,{WHY TRUST YOU?} Why should we trust you?
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.trust2,Do you think you've got better options? Our mission's never changed. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.mission,{WHAT'S YOUR MISSION?} What's your mission? Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.mission2,Protect humanity. Or what's left of it. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.help,{WE WANT TO HELP} We want to help. What can we do? Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.notrouble,{WE WANT NO TROUBLE} We want no trouble. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.nocant,{I CAN’T HELP YOU} We got our own people to look out for. We can’t help you. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.nodiscus,"This isn’t a matter of discussion. We need fuel, food, ammo and volunteers. Over."
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.sure,{WHAT DO YOU NEED?} What do you need? Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.return,{AND IN RETURN?} And in return? Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.resources,We need fuel. We need food. Ammo. Volunteers. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.okay,{WE’LL DO WHAT WE CAN} We’ll do what we can. Over.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.okaycool,We'll send a truck to you soon. The Survivors' Army won’t forget this. Over and out.
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.returnhuh,"Listen, son, you’re in no position to negotiate. Nothing’s changed these past few years. We’re here to keep people safe - yourself included. Over."
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.noway,"{NO. WE DON’T HAVE MUCH} No. We don’t have much, and we can’t afford to share. Over."
call_bgmilitary_05_intro.dialog.nowaydamn,You don’t seem to understand the situation. But we’ll make you understand. Over and out.
dilemma_bgmilitary_06_giveresources.dilemma_bgmilitary_06_giveresources,The army is knocking
dilemma_bgmilitary_06_giveresources.dialog.1,"Sir, the military trucks arrived at our zone. What shall we do?"
dilemma_bgmilitary_06_giveresources.dialog.opt_ok,{GIVE SUPPLIES} Give them what they want.
dilemma_bgmilitary_06_giveresources.dialog.opt_no,{SEND THEM OFF} Tell them to stay away.
dilemma_bgmilitary_06_giveresources.dialog.citizen_nothing,"But chief, we have nothing we can give them."
dilemma_bgmilitary_06_giveresources.dialog.citizen_ok,"Sure, we'll give them what we've got."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.1,"Operator, this is Major Nowak of the Survivors' Army. Since we've taken some of your resources, I can offer you some useful information in exchange. Over."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.reminder,Pick up. Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.reminder2,We've got some things to tell you. Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.itsnothing,{LET'S TALK} You did what you had to. Let's talk then. Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.giveintel,{REQUEST INTEL} I have a few questions for you then. Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.givebackup,{REQUEST BACKUP} We could use some extra guns. Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.askback,"We cannot give you guns nor people. We have our objectives. If we continue our cooperation, we might provide you some cover if you request that by radio, but only if you absolutely need it, don't call us for small encounters. Right now, I can help you learn a bit about the world. Over."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.askaway,Ask away. Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.scientists,{THE INFECTED} What do you know about the infected? Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.scientists_2,"Not much, mostly we just kill them. Over."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.scientists_3,"{MOSTLY?} Wait, what do you mean by ""mostly""? What are you doing with those you don't kill?"
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.classified,This information is classified. Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.howcome,{CLASSIFIED?} How can it be classified? Who's regulating this nowadays?
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.cutthecrap,"{CUT THE CRAP} Cut the crap, how can anything be classified these days? "
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.nothere,"I cannot share that on a public channel. Everybody can be listening in, and we need to ensure the safety of the operation. Over."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.thearmy,{SURVIVORS' ARMY} Tell me about your army. Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.longstory,"When everything went south, our division regrouped and tried to keep together. We weren't nearly enough, so we started to enlist others - police officers, security, even mercenaries. Now we're continuing our mission and trying to wipe the damned infected off the planet. Over."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.raiders,{RAIDERS} Have you had any trouble with raiders? Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.hatethem,"Those damned bastards are everywhere. Robbing, killing, raping, kidnapping, you name it. We're getting rid of this scum whenever we see them. Although there seems to be fewer of them now. Over."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.otherzones,{OTHER ZONES} Have you encountered any other Zones like ours? Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.something,"There are others out there. We've visited quite a few during our missions. They vary in size, population and military strength, and obviously, a lot of them can't make it, but there are some which are still holding on, just like you. Over."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.transmission,{THE TRANSMISSION} Do you happen to know anything about the ongoing transmission encouraging people to leave hiding places? Over.
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.weheard,"Yeah, there were a few settlements that transmitted this kind of invitation. They are mostly all gone now. This one must be sent by some prankster or whoever gets their hands on a long-distance radio transmitter. They never reply anyway. Over."
call_bgmilitary_thanks.dialog.thanks,{THAT'S ALL} Thank you for the information. Over and out.
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.1,"Listen Operator, we need those resources for greater good. I advise you to do what we say. Over."
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.reminder,Don't pretend you can't hear me. Over.
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.opt_ok,{WE WILL PROVIDE} We will give you the requested supplies. Over and out.
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.opt_notok,"{WE WON'T PROVIDE} Stay away, we won't share anything with you."
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.youdbetter,"You'd better do as we say, otherwise we'll burn your Zone to the ground to set an example for others."
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.opt_okk,"{WE WILL PROVIDE} Ok, we will give you what you want, just give us more time. Over."
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.dontbelong,"Don't be long, we're waiting. Over and out."
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.opt_foff,{WE WON'T DO THAT} You won't make us help you with threats. We're done here.
call_bgmilitary_07_give.dialog.done,"You are done for sure, son."
dilemma_bgmilitary_08_consequences.dialog.1,That was a very bad decision. Now you will have to face the consequences.
dilemma_bgmilitary_08_consequences.dialog.reminder,Don't pretend you can't hear me. Over.
dilemma_bgmilitary_08_consequences.dialog.reminder2,"Answer immediately, this is an order. Over."
dilemma_bgmilitary_08_consequences.dialog.opt_ok,"{IT WAS A MISTAKE} It was by mistake, please don't do anything hasty Major."
dilemma_bgmilitary_08_consequences.dialog.opt_notok,{BRING IT ON} Show me what you've got.
dilemma_bgmilitary_08_consequences.dialog.over,No more words. Over and out.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.1,"This is Major Nowak of the Survivors' Army speaking. We suffered heavy casualties, heading in your direction."
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.reminder,Do you copy?
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.what,"{COMING HERE?} This is the Infection Free Zone. I'm not sure I understand. You mean, you're coming here?"
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.youcantjustcome,{YOU CAN'T JUST BARGE IN} This is the operator with Infection Free Zone. This isn't one of your military compounds. You can't just barge in.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.patchup1,Affirmative. We're on our way. We need a secure location to patch up our men.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.patchup2,We can and we will. We got some men who require immediate medical assistance. 
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.whoarethey,{WHO ARE THEY?} Who are they?
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.whofighting,{WHO WERE YOU FIGHTING?} Who were you fighting?
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.whoarethey2,The Army. No need to worry about them.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.whatswrongwithem,{WHAT'S WRONG WITH THEM?} What's wrong with them?
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.whatswrongwithem2,Just wounded.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.whofighting2A,A swarm of infected. You're gonna see one too. And soon.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.whatkind,{WHAT KIND OF WOUNDS?} What kind of wounds?
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.whatkind2,"No one's infected if that's what you're asking. I don't have the time for twenty questions, goddamnit! We're coming. It's your duty to help."
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.idontthink,{WE CAN'T HELP YOU} We can't help you.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.idontthink2,Uh-huh. And why's that?
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.okay,{WE'LL TREAT YOUR PEOPLE} We'll do what we can.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.okay2,Good. Over and out.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.oursacu,{WE HAD CASUALTIES TOO} We had casualties too.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.noresources,{NOT ENOUGH RESOURCES} We don't have enough resources.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.justcant,{WE JUST CAN'T} We just can't.
call_bgmilitary_09_med_request.dialog.idontcare,I don't think you've heard me the first time. We're coming and that's final. Over and out.
dilemma_bgmilitary_10_med_firstaid_alt.dialog.1,"Chief? A military truck arrived at our zone. Most of the men are wounded, with bites and scratches. Some of them are in critical condition. They say they'll stay here until we treat them."
dilemma_bgmilitary_10_med_firstaid_alt.dialog.opt_ok,{LET THEM IN} Let them in.
dilemma_bgmilitary_10_med_firstaid_alt.dialog.opt_no,{WE CAN'T TAKE THEM} We cannot accept them. Tell them to go away.
dilemma_bgmilitary_10_med_firstaid_alt.dialog.opt_what,{WHAT RECRUITS?} What do they mean by new recruits?
dilemma_bgmilitary_10_med_firstaid_alt.dialog.opt_kill,{KILL THEM} Kill them all!
dilemma_bgmilitary_10_med_firstaid_alt.dialog.noidea,"They claim that we need to delegate some people to join their ranks, on Major Nowak's orders."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_begins_alt.dialog.1,"Operator, wounded soldiers of Survivors' Army are spreading a word about the military draft. I'm afraid some people will start leaving us once we aren't the better option. What should we do?"
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_begins_alt.dialog.opt_ok,{LET THEM DECIDE} Give people a choice.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_begins_alt.dialog.opt_notok,{THEY HAVE TO STAY} We need to stop this. Nobody leaves.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day.dialog.1,"Chief, the military are ready to pick up their soldiers, but they're also requesting us to delegate recruits to join their ranks. They offer to send us backup in the future if we do so."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day.dialog.opt_ok,"{RELEASE ONLY SOLDIERS} Give them their people back, nobody else."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day.dialog.opt_okok,{RELEASE SOLDIERS AND FORCE RECRUITS} Give them their people back and choose some of ours to go with them.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day.dialog.opt_vol,"{RELEASE SOLDIERS AND SEND VOLUNTEERS} Give them their people back and if anybody wants to join, let them."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day.dialog.opt_no,"{NOBODY LEAVES} Send them away. We need those soldiers here, they must stay."
dilemma_bgmilitary_were_coming.dialog.1,We've received your call. Survivor's Army will come to your aid. Over.
dilemma_bgmilitary_were_coming.dialog.opt_ok,"{WE'RE WAITING} We're waiting for you, Major. Over and out."
dilemma_bgmilitary_were_coming.dialog.opt_notok,{MAKE HASTE} Ride like the wind Major!
call_bgmilitary_12_cavalry.dialog.1,This is the Survivors' Army. We will come to your aid. Stay at your posts and let the professionals handle that. Over.
call_bgmilitary_12_cavalry.dialog.reminder,Do you copy?
call_bgmilitary_12_cavalry.dialog.opt_ok,"{WOOHOO!} Go get them boys, go get'em! Yeah! Woohoo!"
call_bgmilitary_12_cavalry.dialog.opt_okk,{ROGER} Roger that Major. Over and out.
call_bgmilitary_13_departure.dialog.1,"This is Major Nowak of Survivors' Army. We are grateful for the assistance you provided. We are departing from the area, but call us out if you need some help with the infected."
call_bgmilitary_13_departure.dialog.reminder,Do you copy?
call_bgmilitary_13_departure.dialog.opt_ok,{GODSPEED} Godspeed Major.
call_bgmilitary_13_departure.dialog.opt_okk,{OVER AND OUT} Over and out.
call_bgmilitary_surrender.dialog.1,This is your last chance. Drop your weapons and surrender! You know that you cannot win! Submit and do what you're told.
call_bgmilitary_surrender.dialog.reminder,"Silence will do you no good, answer!"
call_bgmilitary_surrender.dialog.reminder2,Surrender immediately!
call_bgmilitary_surrender.dialog.opt_ok,"{WE SURRENDER} Alright, alright, we got the message. We'll do what you want."
call_bgmilitary_surrender.dialog.opt_notok,"{WE'LL NEVER SURRENDER} Over my dead body. Major, we'll show you what we're made of."
call_bgmilitary_surrender.dialog.opt_ok_2,"You finally came to your senses. It was a wise decision, Operator."
call_bgmilitary_surrender.dialog.opt_notok_2,"So you have chosen death. I can respect that. Men, wipe them out!"
dilemma_bgmilitary_recruits.dialog.1,"Well done Operator, you treated our people and provided us with able recruits. Over."
dilemma_bgmilitary_recruits.dialog.reminder,Pick up. Over.
dilemma_bgmilitary_recruits.dialog.reminder2,Do you copy?
dilemma_bgmilitary_recruits.dialog.opt_ok,"{YOU'RE WELCOME} You're welcome, Major. Over."
dilemma_bgmilitary_recruits.dialog.opt_okk,"{ONE DAY} Maybe I'll give it some thought, but it's not going to happen today."
dilemma_bgmilitary_recruits.dialog.opt_und,We'll be sure to return the favors. Over.
dilemma_bgmilitary_recruits.dialog.opt_end,{I WILL REMEMBER} I'll hold you to your word Major Nowak. Over and out.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_recruits.dialog.1,"Operator, you have my thanks for attending to the wounded, but I was also counting on some people to join my ranks."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_recruits.dialog.reminder,Pick up. Over.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_recruits.dialog.reminder2,Do you copy?
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_recruits.dialog.opt_okk,"{WE WILL DELEGATE} If you insist, I'll send you some people. Take good care of them."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_recruits.dialog.opt_notok,{WE WON'T DELEGATE} That's not going to happen. We need every pair of hands in the Zone.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_recruits.dialog.opt_imp,{IMPOSSIBLE} We have literally nobody to send. It's a ghost town here.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_recruits.dialog.opt_okk_2,A wise decision Operator. You can count on us in your darkest hour. Over and out.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_recruits.dialog.opt_notok_2,"Maybe you're not against us, but you're also not with us. Don't think we'll ever come to your aid. Over and out."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.1,"Where are my men? Release them immediately! You're treading on thin ice, Operator. Over."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.reminder,We know you’re out there. Respond or there will be consequences. Over.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.reminder2,"Silence will do you no good, answer!"
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.opt_notok,{THEY DECIDED TO STAY} They want to stay with us. It seems that our Zone is better than your camp.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.opt_okk,"{I'LL SEND THEM} They're not willing to leave, but we'll make them Major. Over."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.opt_notok_2,"Those men will be considered traitors and deserters! I will not leave it like this! If they won't return, we will make them!"
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.givemen,"{I'LL SEND THEM} They're not willing to leave, but I'll make them Major. Over."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.dontgive,"{I WON'T SEND THEM} They're staying if they want to. We'll protect our citizens, no matter what."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.opt_okk_2,Good choice. Over and out.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_no_draft.dialog.dontgive_2,We'll see about that. You've made a bad choice.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.1,"Chief, the military are ready to pick up their soldiers and recruits to join their ranks, but the people... don't want to leave. Both our citizen and the treated soldiers like it here and want to stay. What happens now?"
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.opt_stay,"{LET THEM STAY} If they really want to stay, let them. "
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.opt_soldiers,{FORCE SOLDIERS OUT} We cannot risk any repercussions. Send the soldiers back.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.opt_recruits,{FORCE ALL OF THEM OUT} Make both soldiers and recruits go. We need to be on good terms with the army.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.opt_stay_2,Are you sure of that? Major Nowak won't like it.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.opt_soldiers_2,"Major won't be too happy without recruits, but we should be fine."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.opt_recruits_2,"I guess that's for the best, but people won't like it."
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.opt_stay_3,{THEY STAY} Every hand that works or holds a gun is precious. They stay.
dilemma_bgmilitary_11_draft_day_alt.dialog.opt_stay_4,Let's hope all hell won't break loose now.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help.dialog.1,"You had your chance to prove yourself and become our ally, but obviously you are not with us. We'll leave you and this place alone, but don't ever think that we'll help you with anything. Over."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help.dialog.reminder,Pick up. Over.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help.dialog.opt_ok,"{I DON'T CARE} I don't care Major, we never needed you here in the first place."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help.dialog.opt_notok,"{APOLOGIZE} You have my apologies, Major, we could do better. Over and out."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.1,"Operator, this is your last chance. Release my men now, or we'll make short work of you and your zone. "
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.reminder,Don't pretend you can't hear me. Over.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.reminder2,"Answer immediately, this is an order. Over."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_force,"{I'LL FORCE THEM OUT} They're all yours then, Major, I'll make them go."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice,"{IT'S THEIR CHOICE} What these soldiers want to do is not my choice, and it's not yours either. It's theirs."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_stay,{THEY STAY} We're not letting them go. They're part of the Zone now.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice_2,"What do you mean by 'their choice'? They are soldiers, and soldiers follow orders. So should you."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice_3,"{THEY ARE HUMANS} They may be soldiers, but they're also humans. Making their own choices, like you and me."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice_4,I am their commander. Their leader. They have to follow me.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice_5,"{PEOPLE CHOOSE LEADERS} People choose and follow good leaders because they want to, not because they have to. They chose our zone. Are you really willing to sacrifice so many lives to prove a point? A  commander like you?"
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice_6,"Dammit! You're making sense, but I didn't come all this way for nothing. If you want these men, you will pay for them with resources."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_resources,{GIVE RESOURCES} Thank you Major. We'll provide you with all you need.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice_8,".... Fine. We have a deal. Let's hope you're half as good a leader as you claim to be. I'll let your Zone exist. But only for my boys' sake, are we clear?"
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice_6_alt,We didn't come all this way for nothing! 
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_resources_alt,{TAKE RESOURCES} We can offer you some valuable resources as an act of good will. 
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_choice_9,"{CLEAR} Crystal clear, Major."
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_ok_2,A wise decision Operator. Over and out.
dilemma_bgmilitary_no_help_demand.dialog.opt_no_2,That's it then. Prepare to die with these traitors. OPEN FIRE!
call_bgmilitary_no_cavalry.dialog.1,"We cannot help you this time, we are dealing with a much bigger threat at the moment."
call_bgmilitary_no_cavalry.dialog.opt_ok,"{UNDERSTOOD} Understood, Major. Good luck. "
call_bgmilitary_no_cavalry_2.dialog.1,"We're not in the area and not coming back for a few months, Operator. Godspeed."
call_bgmilitary_no_cavalry_2.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} Ok, let me know when you're back in the area."
call_bgmilitary_cavalry_around.dialog.1,"Operator, we're in the area again. Let us know if you need our cover."
call_bgmilitary_cavalry_around.dialog.opt_ok,"{I'LL DO THAT} Thank you Major, I'll keep it in mind."
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge1_start.dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge1_start,Prepandemic Lab
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge1_start.dialog.1,"Operator, we've got into some old abandoned lab. It was closed shut, but we found the way through the vents. Looks like it was evacuated right before the pandemic. There's a lot of stuff in here... it could take us some time to get through all this. "
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge1_start.dialog.opt1,{BRIEF SCAN} Do a brief scan.
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge1_start.dialog.opt2,{DETAILED SCAN} Do a detailed scan.
dilemma_bgscientists_pre_traps_found.dialog.1,"Operator, we found something suspicious. There is a large piece of dried meat here with a piece of rope around it, it's attached to a counterweight. This seems to be a trap to catch something... maybe humans, maybe some animals, or maybe even the infected. Somebody must have set it up not so long ago."
dilemma_bgscientists_pre_traps_found.dialog.opt_ok,{LEAVE IT} Leave it as it is.
dilemma_bgscientists_pre_traps_found.dialog.opt_notok,{INSPECT} Make sure it's disarmed and try to find out more about it.
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation1_citizenskills.dialog.1,"Chief, we had an incident last night. One of our citizens attacked his neighbor, who tried to defend but didn't stand a chance. Neither of them made it. The aggressor... we spotted signs of the infection. And this means we're not immune after all. Either that or the virus is mutating. I'm not sure which is worse."
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation1_citizenskills.dialog.opt1,"{LET EVERYBODY KNOW} Inform the people, they need to be more careful now."
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation1_citizenskills.dialog.opt2,"{COVER IT UP} People can't know, cover it up."
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.1,"Operator, we've found an old, abandoned lab. We've managed to turn the systems on and... there are security cam recordings here. Pre-pandemic. You gotta hear this..."
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.letshearit,{PUT IT THROUGH} Put it through.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.goodwork,{GOOD WORK} Good work.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.recordingstarts,What is the meaning of this? How dare you?!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.recordingstarts2,We don't have time for this. Get your things. We're leaving.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.why,Why? You still haven't told me. My team deserves to know.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.comp,This facility is compromised.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.mean,What does that even mean?!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.mean2,It means you have to go. You have to move.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.cannotbese,You cannot be serious. We can't just pack up and leave!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.cannotbese2,You have to. We're evacuating you to a secure location...
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.youdnot,You don't understand. Our research. We're in the middle of work!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.youdnot2,The new facility is safer. It's hidden deep underground. You'll continue your research there.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.thiscantbe,This... I can't... we can't. We won't. Everything's here! It's about the future of humanity!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.thiscantbe2,Dr. Miller...
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.labequ,What about our lab equipment?!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.labequ2,We'll provide everything you need.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.iwontac,I won't accept this.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.iwontac2,You don't have a choice.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.infrast,The whole infrastructure's here!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.infrast2,"Doctor, this is not a request."
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.fragilesampl,Fragile samples! Years of research!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.fragilesamp2,I have my orders.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.idontcare,I don't care about your orders!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.idontcare2,"As I said, there's no time. Take her away."
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.independent,This is an independent research facility! You have no right!
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.independen2,We have every right. Shut that damn thing off.
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.thisisiti,"That's all there is. The recording ends here. The whole facility was evacuated by the military, but we don't know where to."
call_bgscientists_01_labscavenge2_evacuation.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} That's too bad, thanks for the report."
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge3_points.dialog.1,"Chief, this place is a dead end. There's nothing that could help us locate the lab from the recording. There are just some papers with some scientific gibberish. "
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge3_points.dialog.opt1,"{TAKE EVERYTHING} Take the papers with you, they might be useful."
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge4_coordinates.dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge4_coordinates,Scientists' Evac
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge4_coordinates.dialog.1,"Sir, we found it! We got one of the laptops up and running, and there's an email... Dated right before the world went to hell. They've been evacuated to an old military base. It's pretty far away, but getting there shouldn't be an issue. Uploading the coordinates now."
dilemma_bgscientists_01_labscavenge4_coordinates.dialog.opt1,{GOOD JOB} Good job!
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.1,"We've found the base where the scientists were evacuated. People are definitely living here. They set up some systems, providing power. There’s something like an entrance to an underground complex. We can see the security cameras moving."
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.opt2,{TRY TO GET IN} See if you can open the door somehow.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.goaway,This is Dr Miller of the science division! You are trespassing on the territory of an infection research facility. Please leave immediately!
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.onyourway,"Be on your way then, and don't bother us again without a good reason."
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.weknowyou,{WE KNOW YOU} We found footage of your evacuation. We have come to check if you're still alive.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.officialifz,{WE'RE OFFICIAL IFZ} We are one of the IFZs set up by the government during the pandemic. I worked as a registered emergency services operator back then.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.alrightthen,"Did you? I have to check this... *keyboard clicking* .... It seems like your faces are recognized by the system. Alright then, what do you want from us?"
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.opennow,{YOU'D BETTER OPEN} Open the doors and no harm will come to you.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.goodluck,Good luck penetrating the blast doors! We are well equipped for visitors like you! One call and you shall have some army men on your back!
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.iknowthem,{I KNOW THE ARMY} I think I know your army men. I had the pleasure of meeting Major Nowak.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.wewantifo,{WE WANT INFORMATION} We need some information from you about the infection.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.notthistime,This is not some kind of education platform. Maybe we will share some when we know we can trust you.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.whatyoudo,{YOUR RESEARCH} What are you doing here?
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.lastofus,"We are one of the last surviving facilities that researches the infection, looking for a vaccine. This is all we can tell now."
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.helpyou,{WE WANT TO HELP} All we want is to help you.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.howcanyou,And how could you possibly help us?
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.youtellme,{YOU TELL ME} You tell me.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.anything,{OFFER RESOURCES} We can provide you with some resources.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.youcanhelp,"There is a thing you could actually help us with. There used to be another research lab nearby. If we're lucky enough, you will find a case with biohazard signs there. Bring it to us. We need the data and samples stored there."
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.access,{ACCESS TO DATABASE} Can't you access your own databases?
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.nointernet,"Most of them were left there during the evacuation... and the internet, as you might've noticed, hasn't been working that well these past few years."
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.crates,{WHAT'S INSIDE?} What's inside the case?
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.sleepbetter,"Highly valuable data, required for our research. Do not open it!"
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.welldothis,{WE'LL GET IT} We'll get it for you. 
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.nocando,{WE WON'T HELP} We will not do this. It sounds too fishy.
call_bgscientists_02_help2_goaway.dialog.excellent,Excellent. We will send you the coordinates then. Do not come back empty-handed.
dilemma_bgscientists_second_chance_to_help.dialog.1,"Operator, this is Dr Miller speaking. Have you reconsidered working with us? What we're doing here is for the greater good. Good and future of the entire humankind."
dilemma_bgscientists_second_chance_to_help.dialog.opt1,{WE'LL HELP YOU} We've given it some thought. We'll work with you.
dilemma_bgscientists_second_chance_to_help.dialog.opt2,"{WE WON'T HELP YOU} The answer's still no. We don't trust you enough, we can manage on our own."
dilemma_bgscientists_second_chance_to_help.dialog.opt1_2,I'm glad to hear that you've come to your senses. Let's get down to work then.
dilemma_bgscientists_second_chance_to_help.dialog.opt2_2,"You're just as ignorant as everybody else! Fine then, we don't need anybody! We'll do it ourselves."
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation2_sickpeople.dialog.1,"Sir, there have been more incidents. People who should be immune keep getting sick. There's no doubt that the virus is mutating."
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation2_sickpeople.dialog.opt1,"{WE NEED VACCINES} We need vaccines, and we need them quickly. We should prioritize the research."
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation2_sickpeople.dialog.opt2,{PUT THEM IN THE HOSPITAL} We need to put them in the hospital. Keep them alive and restrained.
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation2_sickpeople.dialog.opt3,{WE NEED MORE NIGHTWATCH} Increase safety measures.
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help3_secondlab.dialog.1,"Operator, we're here, and the place still reeks of the infected, there's lots of them inside. It's going to be a tough fight if we're to get what the scientists have sent us for. Are you sure we're ready for that, or should we bring more, better-equipped people?"
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help3_secondlab.dialog.opt1,{WITHDRAW} We'll get in there later.
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help3_secondlab.dialog.opt2,"{PROCEED} We have to get it now, get inside."
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help4_foetus_box.dialog.1,"We're inside, infected cleared, case retrieved. This place looks like it's been abandoned for years. Wait a second... you found what? Oh, God... Alright, they definitely did something here. There are operating tables and steel cages. Ugh, the smell... These people are still inside. The bodies... What the hell is this place? "
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help4_foetus_box.dialog.opt1,{GET THE CASE AND LEAVE} Just get what we need and leave as soon as possible.
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help4_foetus_box.dialog.trust,"We will, but I'm thinking... Should we take a look inside the case? I know Dr Miller asked us not to, but now, looking at this place... I really don't know if we can trust these guys."
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help4_foetus_box.dialog.open,{OPEN THE CASE} Let's see what they're trying to hide then.
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help4_foetus_box.dialog.dontopen,"{DON'T OPEN THE CASE} No, the risk of damaging the contents is too great."
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help4_foetus_box.dialog.open_2,"Alright, let's find out... HOLY MOTHER OF... What the hell!? There's a developed fetus inside! In formaldehyde. And it looks infected!"
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help4_foetus_box.dialog.open_3,"{DELIVER THE CASE} I'd sleep better if we hadn't found out. Let's get the case to Dr Miller, it's on her conscience."
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help4_foetus_box.dialog.dontopen_2,"Alright, the faster we're out of here the better. Let's get the case to Doc."
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.1,You're back. Did you retrieve the case?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.reminder,Are you there?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.yea,{TAKE IT} Yes. My people will give it to you.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.goodthanks,"Good. Thank you, you have no idea how much it means."
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.yeabut,{ANSWERS FIRST} Yes. But we need some answers first.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.huhwhatquest,What kind of answers? I don't like playing games. 
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.whatisit,{WHAT'S IN THE CASE?} What's in the case?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.whatisit2,The proof that our research bears fruit. Good scientists gave their lives for these samples.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.welostpeopletoo,{WE'VE LOST PEOPLE TOO} We've lost people too.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.welostpeopletoo2,... Those are the sacrifices we have to make to get our world back. 
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.howitstarted,{ORIGINS OF THE VIRUS} Do you happen to know anything about how the virus came to be?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.storyshort,"We don't know the big picture. It was surely engineered by humans, possibly as some kind of a biological weapon. It seems to be a combination of various diseases, such as mad cow disease, Nipah or Hendra virus. It's still hard to believe that somebody took such great lengths to design, basically, non-lethal human rabies. "
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.releasedhow,{HOW DID IT SPREAD?} How did the virus spread?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.noidea,"We don't know that much about it, we've been evacuated underground soon after the outbreak. The virus is airborne. Judging by how fast it went around the world, I'd say it must've gotten to airports and water supplies. As to how it left the creation lab... we can only guess."
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.creationlab,{CREATION LAB?} Creation lab? Do you mean that you know where the virus was made?!
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.creationlab_2,"Erm... Not really, no. We've heard of it, but... never gotten to know the exact location. It's surely gone by now."
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.howmany,{HOW MANY OF YOU ARE THERE?} How many of you are there?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.howmany2,There aren't many of us left. We can't afford to lose anyone else.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.whencure,{WHEN WILL THE CURE BE READY?} When will the cure be ready?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.whencure2,We're still researching the vaccine. Our approach is extremely diligent. Cure development is not a subject I'd like to explain.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.anythingelse,{ANYTHING ELSE?} Do you need anything else?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.anythingelse2,"Actually... yes. Our vaccine reached a testing phase during the outbreak, but we could not continue."
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.willbeonow,{WE'LL BE ON OUR WAY} Let's hope this will make a difference. We'll be on our way.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.willbeonow2,Wait. Before you leave... The vaccine research. We had to suspend the testing when we were evacuated.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.whatdoyouneed,{WHAT HAPPENED?} What happened?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.whatdoyouneed2,"Our testing facility went down, and now we have to run the tests on our own. We need samples of the infected to isolate the mutated virus."
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.sowhatisneeded,{WHAT DO YOU NEED?} What do you need?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.sowhatisneeded2,Fresh samples of infected subjects to isolate the mutated virus.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.whatkind,{WHAT KIND?} What kind of samples?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.Boptioninfected,"We need some freshly harvested organs from an alpha infected. If you kill it as close to our lab as possible, you will be able to deliver them fast enough."
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.daaaanger_alt,{AN ALPHA?!} You want us to cut up alpha infected?! Right after we kill it?! Why do you even need its organs?
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.daaaanger2,"The way alphas grow and react to the virus is unprecedented, there must be something abnormal about their DNA. The samples must be fresh so that we can observe the virus while it's still active."
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.wewont,{WE CAN'T} We can't do that.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.wecantanymore2,Remember... it's all about the future. Nothing else matters. We can't forsake it.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.okaywewill,{ALRIGHT} Alright. We'll do this for you.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.wecantanymore,{NOT RIGHT NOW} We can't help you with this right now.
call_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest.dialog.okaywewill2,Excellent. Bring them to us as soon as you're done.
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest_tooslow.dialog.1,"Darn, you were too late! These samples are useless now. We'll need another batch, and make sure it comes faster than this one. "
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest_tooslow.dialog.tryagain,"{WE'LL TRY AGAIN} Alright Doc, we'll give it another shot."
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest_tooslow.dialog.tryagain_2,I expect you not to fail this time. This is for our future.
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest_tooslow.dialog.notryagain,{FORGET IT} Forget it. We already risked enough for your precious little research. 
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest_tooslow.dialog.notryagain_2,Fine. But don't expect us to help you when your people start dying from the mad virus.
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help5_secondrequest_tooslow.dialog.notryagain_3,"{WE DON'T NEED YOU} We can deal with the virus ourselves. Have fun with alphas, Doc."
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation3_turned_night.dialog.1,"Chief, we had another infected citizen. Turned mad overnight, and attacked his whole family in the morning. Killed his wife and brother. His daughters managed to run away and alarm everybody. The man is in quarantine. We have to do something about this. "
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation3_turned_night.dialog.opt1,{KEEP ME UPDATED} Keep me posted.
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation3_turned_night.dialog.opt2,"{QUARANTINE THE CHILDREN} Put the girls under observation as well, we can't take any chances."
dilemma_bgscientists_post_mutation3_turned_night.dialog.opt3,{NEUTRALIZE THE MAN} Neutralize him. We can't afford such risk within the Zone.
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help6_infected_delivered.dilemma_bgscientists_02_help6_infected_delivered,Helping the Scientists
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help6_infected_delivered.dialog.1,"Operator, status report. We've managed to secure and deliver the samples to the scientists. I just hope it was worth our effort. "
dilemma_bgscientists_02_help6_infected_delivered.dialog.opt1,{GOOD JOB} Good job everybody.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.1,Dr. Miller speaking. I have wonderful news! We're on the verge of a breakthrough in vaccine creation!
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.reminder,We're getting somewhere. Finally!
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.reminder2,"Operator, you really want to hear this."
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.great,{BREAKTHROUGH?} What do you mean by 'breakthrough'?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.great2,"It's too early to get your hopes up, but we're getting close to the end of our research. There's just one last thing we need."
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.cure,{HOW ABOUT A CURE?} You didn't want to tell me about the cure before. Are you getting close to creating it as well?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.cure2,"I have to tell you that making a cure is impossible. The virus causes severe brain damage in the frontal lobe, which renders the infected incapable of any complex reasoning and emotional control. It makes them like rabid animals, and the only thing to do with such animals is, well, put them down."
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.cure5,{THEY'RE STILL PEOPLE} But the infected used to be people. How can you even think of them like this?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.cure6,"As you said, they used to. If you're such a protector of the infected, would you mind telling me how many you and your people have killed so far, huh? ...I thought so."
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.whatisitii,{WHAT IS IT?} What is it?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.volunt,We have to start running tests on people. We need volunteers.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.ourpeople,{OUR PEOPLE?} You want to test it on our people?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.ourpeople2,"Yes. It's not like we can test it on ourselves, we're already short-handed, and the research cannot wait."
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.whenpeopl,{WHEN?} When do you want to start the tests?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.whenpeopl2,As soon as we can.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.howmanysubj,{HOW MANY?} How many do you need?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.howmanysubj2,Eight people should suffice. But we might need more later.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.dangeroussubj,{WHAT WILL HAPPEN TO THEM?} What will happen to them?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.dangeroussubj2,We have to check for any side effects. What's important is that what we're doing here will benefit humanity as a whole.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.willtheylive,{WILL THEY SURVIVE?} But will they survive?
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.willtheylive2,There's no guarantee. Some of the test subjects might not make it. We won't know until we start the trials.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.mypoeple,{I CAN'T FORCE ANYONE} These are my people. I have to keep them safe. 
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.mypoeple2,You will keep them safe by fighting the root cause. The infection.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.sendsb,{WE'LL SEND SOMEBODY} When you put it this way... Alright. We'll think of somebody.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.youreaskingalot,{YOU'RE ASKING A LOT} You're asking a lot.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.toodang2,"Just think about it. We could get a working vaccine, and in the future, maybe even get rid of infection! Restore the cities! Rebuild our society! Get our lives back! THIS IS WORTH IT."
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start.dialog.wnntrisk,{I WON'T DO THAT} I won't risk their lives.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start_2.dialog.1,"Chief, we thought about this... send us. We volunteer. We put our lives on the line every day for our folks. Let us do this thing as well."
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start_2.dialog.okiwill,"{OKAY, I'LL SEND YOU} Okay. Let's do this. Are you listening in, Doctor?"
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start_2.dialog.okiwill2,I'm glad you see things the way they are. We'll be waiting.
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start_2.dialog.noway,"{NO WAY} No way, I'm not letting you go, this is too dangerous. It's my final decision. Are you listening in, Miller?"
call_bgscientists_02_help7_volunteers_start_2.dialog.wnntrisk2,You're making a terrible mistake. All the deaths we could prevent are on you now.
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.1,"Operator, come in. This is Dr. Miller speaking. I've got important information."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.whaysup,"{GO AHEAD} This is the operator. Go ahead, doctor."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.whaysup2,I've got great news. We did it - our research paid off. We developed a working vaccine!
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.nofav,{NO MORE FAVORS} No more favors. We've done enough.
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.nofav2,...well. We thought you ought to be informed. We've developed a vaccine.
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.myguys,{WHAT HAPPENED TO OUR PEOPLE?} What happened to the volunteers I sent you?
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.wellshit,"They will be on their way back to you as soon as possible. Unfortunately, not all of them survived the tests, but their sacrifice allowed us to make the final corrections to the vaccine "
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.whatmean,{HOW WILL IT HELP?} What does it mean now? Will it cure everyone?
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.whatmean2,"It means your people won't get infected with the mutated virus anymore. If they do, the vaccinated people will be able to deal with the virus."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.whatnow,{HOW TO USE IT?} What happens now? How to use the vaccine?
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.whatnow2,"We will give the first batch of the vaccine to your squads, along with our research notes, so that you can produce it yourselves. Take them and give the rest to your people, you've earned it."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.andtheinf,{WILL IT HELP THE INFECTED?} Will it help the infected as well?
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.andtheinf2,"No... you have to understand, this is not a cure. The vaccine is designed for people who don't have any symptoms."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.stillssymptoms,{SYMPTOMS?} So the symptoms will still be there?
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.stillssymptoms2,"Not always, but they could be. However, the infection will act like a regular cold, lasting up to 5 or 6 days."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.dangers,{SIDE EFFECTS?} Are there any side effects?
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.dangers2,"The clinical trials have proven the vaccine is safe and works. As for long-term effects, we can never be sure."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.howlong,{DOES THE VACCINE WEAR OFF?} Do the vaccine's effects wear off?
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.howlong2,"We're not sure yet. The vaccination process may have to be renewed, once a year preferably. The virus will most likely still mutate, and therefore we will have to research new vaccines."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.okay,{WE'LL GET IT} We'll get it.
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.thankyou,Thank you. I really value our little... partnership. We'll talk more later.
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.notokay,"{WE DON'T WANT IT} Hell only knows what you've put in these vaccines. They killed two of our people. Keep this shit, we don't want it."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.notokay2,Are you for real?! You'd rather let your people get infected and die when you have the working vaccine ready?! 
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.notokay3,"{YES, I'M SURE} I'm pretty certain it'll kill more people than it can possibly save. You are not to be trusted. "
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.okaythen,"{LET IT BE, WE'LL TAKE IT} We still don't trust you, but if you're so convinced, let it be. But the vaccine had better work, or you'll regret it."
call_bgscientists_03_vaccine1_ready.dialog.notokay4,Suit yourselves then. But don't come crawling back to us when you get wiped out.
dilemma_bgscientists_vaccine_followup.dialog.1,"Operator, the number of people falling ill has dropped significantly since we administered the vaccine. Our people are finally at ease."
dilemma_bgscientists_vaccine_followup.dialog.opt1,{THAT'S GREAT} That's great news. It was all worth it.
dilemma_bgscientists_new_vaccine_needed.dialog.1,"Chief, new cases of infection were spotted within our zone. It seems that the virus is mutating and the vaccine is not effective anymore. We need to research and produce a new one in a hospital."
dilemma_bgscientists_new_vaccine_needed.dialog.opt1,"{LET'S DO THIS} Ok, we'll tell our scientists to do so."
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.reminder,"We're under attack, we need help, now!!!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.reminder2,"Pick up, pick up, pick up, goddammit!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.1,"Operator, this is Dr. Miller, do you copy? We're under attack, I repeat, we're under attack!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.what,{WHAT'S HAPPENING?} What on Earth is happening there?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.breach,"Blast doors were blown up, they're trying to kill us all!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.who,{WHO IS ATTACKING?} Who's attacking you?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.people,"I have no idea, but they are people, not infected!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.people2,{WHAT PEOPLE?} People?! Who exactly?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.dontknow,"No idea, they've just started shooting!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.army,{CALL THE ARMY} Have you tried calling the Survivors' Army?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.nores,"They don't respond, we need you!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.fight,{CAN YOU FIGHT BACK?} How long can you fend them off?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.cantfi,"We can't, just come as soon as possible!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.help,{WE ARE COMING} We're on our way!
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.nohelp,"{WE WON'T MAKE IT} We can't make it, you're too far away! Barricade yourselves, fight for survival!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack.dialog.haste,"...NO! Stop, we surrender! What do you want? Argh!"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.1,"Operator, we've reached the lab. The scientists... they were decimated. All the data and samples were either destroyed or taken away. All is lost."
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.opt1,{WHAT ABOUT MILLER?} Have you found Doctor Miller?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.body,"Yeah, we've found her body, it's not a pretty sight... death must've been instant. There aren't any survivors."
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.opt2,{WHO DID IT?} Can you tell who did it?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.attacker,Hardly. There's one thing here that doesn't add up though... a torn-off arm of the infected with a peculiar symbol tattooed on it. Must've been from some explosion.
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.attacker2,{WHAT DOES IT MEAN?} Any ideas what it might mean?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.attacker3,Not really. Never seen one like it before.
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.whatelse,{ANYTHING ELSE?} Can you tell me anything else about the situation?
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.whatelse2,"Yeah, one more thing. This wasn't a robbery by some raiders. They made sure not to leave any survivors. Every single piece of equipment was diligently destroyed, most of it burned. Why would they do this?"
call_bgscientists_lab_attack_followup.dialog.whatelse3,{GET BACK TO THE HQ} Let's hope that we'll find out sooner than later and deal with them. Get back ASAP.
call_guffin_antenna.dialog.1,To all survivors. The infection is in decline. Seek others and rebuild…
call_guffin_antenna.dialog.reminder,To all survivors. The infection is in decline. Seek others and rebuild…
call_guffin_antenna.dialog.no_answer,To all survivors. The infection is in decline. Seek others and rebuild…
call_guffin_antenna.dialog.no_answer2,To all survivors. The infection is in decline. Seek others and rebuild…
call_guffin_antenna.dialog.squadrep,"It doesn't seem like can they hear us. Maybe they're not listening at all… If we want to get to the source of that transmission, we'll have to go beyond our closest neighborhood."
call_guffin_antenna.dialog.oprep,{OK} OK. We should consider sending our squads to neighboring areas.
dilemma_first_expedition.dialog.1,"Chief, we've finally got here. We'll scavenge this entire area for resources and look for anything of interest. Let's hope this place isn't infested."
dilemma_first_expedition.dialog.opt_ok,"{OK} Thanks for the report, stay sharp."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.1,To anyone who survived. The infection is in decline. Leave your shelters and help us make the world habitable again. Help us to reclaim the Earth.
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.reminder,"Are you there? This is vital, bigger than you or me."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.reminder2,This matter shouldn't wait. Please answer if you can hear us.
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.hello,"{HELLO!} Hello, this is the Infection Free Zone, do you copy us?"
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.hithere,{ANYONE THERE?} Is there anyone who can answer us?
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.wecopy,"Yes, we can hear you loud and clear."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.great,"{GOOD TO HEAR YOU} Good to hear you, it's a high time you answered. I've wanted to speak with you ever since I left the shelter. "
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.great_1,The pleasure is mine. It's good to hear that our message has reached somebody.
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.great_2,{WHY NO ANSWER BEFORE?} Why didn't you answer before?
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.great_3,"The message was automated, and we had almost no responses. Your answer is one of the very few we've heard."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.why,"{WHY DO YOU TRANSMIT?} Why did you start doing that, and why now?"
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.why_1,We've been on the surface since the very beginning of the infection. We were waiting for a good moment to inform people that the situation has improved.
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.why_2,{IS IT BETTER NOW?} Has it really improved so much?
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.why_3,"It's still far from perfect, but it's much better than it was before."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.change,{THE TRANSMISSION CHANGED} Why did you change the content of the transmission?
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.change_1,Because it was a high time we moved on and started doing something about the situation we're all facing.
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.whodis,{WHO ARE YOU?} Who are you?
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.whodis_1,"We are survivors, just like you. "
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.whoexact,{WHO ARE YOU EXACTLY?} That doesn't say much. Who are you exactly?
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.whoexact_1,We are a group of people who simply want to heal the world - to rebuild and make a safe haven for everyone.
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.yourplan,{WHAT'S YOUR PLAN?} What do you want to do?
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.yourplan_1,"We want to save all living beings. We can't tell you more now, the radio is not safe, and there are people trying to interfere. But we can send a team to meet you and give more information about it personally. Where are you located?"
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.whostop,{WHO WANTS TO STOP YOU?} Who are the people who want to stop you?
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.whostop_1,"Not everybody wants what is best for everyone. There are many different groups with their private agendas, and I believe you've met some of them already."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.locationus,{WE ARE IN [[STARTING_CITY]]} We are located at [[address-marker_hq_event_provirus_05_guffin_answered]]. 
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.locationyou,{YOUR LOCATION FIRST} Tell me where you are first.
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.cool,"That's within our reach. Let's meet up, I'll send you coordinates to a nearby place where we can meet on neutral ground. See you there."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.cool2,"Sorry, but trust should be mutual. If you're not saying, then why should we? Let's meet in a neutral place instead. I'll send you the coordinates. See you soon."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.seeyou,"{WE'LL MEET YOU} It sounds fine, see you then."
call_provirus_05_guffin_answered.dialog.noway,"{WE'LL THINK ABOUT IT} Thanks for the coordinates, we'll think about it."
dilemma_provirus_03_guffin_changed.dialog.1,To anyone out there. The infection is in decline. Reach out and seek us. We can help you.
dilemma_provirus_03_guffin_changed.dialog.reminder,To anyone out there. The infection is in decline. Reach out and seek us. We can help you.
dilemma_provirus_03_guffin_changed.dialog.changed,{CHANGES} You have changed the transmission!
dilemma_provirus_03_guffin_changed.dialog.doyoucopy,"{DO YOU COPY?} This is the Infection Free Zone of [[STARTING_CITY]], do you copy?"
dilemma_provirus_03_guffin_changed.dialog.no_answer,To anyone out there. The infection is in decline. Reach out and seek us. We can help you.
dilemma_provirus_03_guffin_changed.dialog.pleaseans,"{PLEASE ANSWER} Answer us, please."
dilemma_provirus_03_guffin_changed.dialog.no_answer2,To anyone out there. The infection is in decline. Reach out and seek us. We can help you.
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.1,"This place was full of the infected! There were no signs of our contacts. They're either gone, dead or they've set us up!"
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.opt_ok,{BAD LUCK} The whole world is full of infected.
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.not_like,Not like this. There were too many of them in a single building
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.opt_call,{LET ME CALL THEM} Let me call them on an open channel. *kshh* This is the Infection Free Zone to the group we were supposed to meet. Please respond.
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.callout,This is the Infection Free Zone to the group we were supposed to meet. Please respond.
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.callout_ans,...
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.callout_rep,{REPEAT} This is the Infection Free Zone. Is anyone there?
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.callout_rep_ans,...
dilemma_provirus_06_followup.dialog.useless,{THAT'S ALL} There is nothing we can do for now. We will have to wait to see how this unfolds. Over and out.
dilemma_provirus_tattoo.dialog.1,"Operator, the last horde we killed was somehow... different. Most of the infected turned recently, and some had tattoos, similar to what we've seen on an arm we found in the raided lab. I've got a bad feeling about this.\n"
dilemma_provirus_tattoo.dialog.opt_ok,{KEEP AN EYE OUT} Noted. Let me know if you see more of these tattoos.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_infection.dialog.1,"Chief, the illness rate is going up rapidly, and unrest is growing within the zone. Something's not right."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_infection.dialog.opt_tighten,{ISOLATE AND PATROL} Isolate people and stay on high alert. Squads should be vigilant.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_infection.dialog.opt_cover,{DON'T TELL PEOPLE} People don't need to know this.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_infection.dialog.opt_ignore,"{AS USUAL} It must be another mutation, we'll deal with it."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_vaccines.dialog.1,"Boss, our vaccines... Somebody destroyed them. We've found boxes smashed on a storage floor. I'd like to believe it was an accident, but... it doesn't look like one."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_vaccines.dialog.opt_tighten,{TIGHTEN SECURITY} Tell the squads and workers to report any suspicious behaviors around vaccines.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_vaccines.dialog.opt_cover,"{COVER IT UP} We need to cover it up, people cannot know."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_vaccines.dialog.opt_ignore,"{WE'LL MAKE NEW} We can make more quickly, we'll be fine."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_vehicles.dialog.1,"Sir, somebody tampered with one of our vehicles. Punctured tyres, cut brakes and fuel line... Why would anybody do this?"
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_vehicles.dialog.opt_tighten,"{WATCH THE VEHICLES} No idea, but we need to find whoever did this. Let nobody but squads be near the vehicles."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_vehicles.dialog.opt_cover,{KEEP IT SECRET} Let's keep it between us and those who discovered it.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_vehicles.dialog.opt_ignore,"{WE CAN REPAIR IT} Ignore it, we can just fix the car."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_gate.dialog.1,"Operator, watchmen report structural damage in one of our gates. I can't believe it happened by itself, somebody must've done it on purpose."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_gate.dialog.opt_tighten,{INCREASE SECURITY} Tell the watchmen to verify people crossing the gates.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_gate.dialog.opt_cover,{WE MUSTN'T TELL ANYONE} We can't let anyone know about it.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_gate.dialog.opt_ignore,"{IGNORE IT} Things like this happen, we will fix it."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_resources.dialog.1,"Chief, our food supplies and some of the ammo were soaked up. We won't be able to use a big part of it. Somebody must've done this on purpose."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_resources.dialog.opt_tighten,{WATCH THE SUPPLIES} Tell people to report if anyone behaves funny around our stores.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_resources.dialog.opt_cover,"{REMOVE TRACES} Get rid of everything that can't be used, but don't let anyone see you doing this."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_resources.dialog.opt_ignore,"{WE'LL MAKE MORE} It doesn't matter, we'll make more."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_lab.dialog.1,"Boss, something happened in our lab. Researchers found their notes torn, and the entire lab ravaged, as if somebody wanted to stop them. Should we do something about it?"
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_lab.dialog.opt_tighten,"{KEEP AN EYE ON LABS} We'll control who comes in and out of labs, just to be secure."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_lab.dialog.opt_cover,{THIS CAN'T GET OUT} They shouldn't tell anyone.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_lab.dialog.opt_ignore,"{THEY'LL BE FINE} They're smart, they'll deal with it."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_murder.dialog.1,"Sir, we've found some of our workers dead in their quarters. They must've been killed in their sleep, someone just slit their throats!"
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_murder.dialog.opt_tighten,"{WATCH THE SHELTERS} From now on, we'll keep watches at night, we can't let this happen again."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_murder.dialog.opt_cover,{DISPOSE OF BODIES} Get rid of the bodies and tell people they left the zone. The truth can't get out.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_murder.dialog.opt_ignore,"{DO NOTHING} Sounds like some personal vendetta, we shouldn't intervene."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_discovered.dialog.1,"Operator, people found out that we were hiding saboteur activities. They are furious, and some of them want to leave the zone. What should we do?"
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_discovered.dialog.opt_tighten,"{HIGH ALERT} Alert the entire zone, everybody should report any suspicious activity from now on."
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_discovered.dialog.opt_cover,{LET THEM GO} Let them. We don't need any extra problems now.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_discovered.dialog.opt_ignore,{THREATEN} Nobody leaves. Shoot them if they don't obey. \r\n
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.1,"Operator, are you alright?! Our guys just caught the saboteur, as she was sneaking through the HQ armed! She was trying to get to you!"
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.opt_check,{} Search her
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.opt_shoot,{} Shoot her down
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.revelation_search,"Holy shit! She's bald and pale like the infected, but seems intelligent! She's also got this tattoo we've seen before. What are we going to do with her?"
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.revelation_kill,"Holy shit! She looks like the infected! Bald, pale, and got one of these tattoos! What the hell was this thing? Did she get sick recently?!"
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.soon,{IT DOESN'T MATTER} It doesn't matter. She's not a problem anymore.
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.opt_kill,"{EXECUTE} We can't take any chances, kill her immediately."
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.opt_kill_reply,As you command. Shoot her!
call_provirus_the_interrogation.dialog.opt_interrogate,{INTERROGATE} It's high time we heard some answers. Tie her down to a chair. I'll question her myself. 
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.1,"She didn't say a word so far. I'm not even sure if she's able to. She doesn't seem resistant to UV light, but can endure a lot of pain. She's all yours, Chief."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.knowme,{DO YOU KNOW ME?} I am the chief of this zone. Do you know me?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.yes_1,...Yes.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.killme,{}Did you try to kill me?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.yes_2,Yes.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.sabotageus,{}Did you sabotage us?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.yes_3,Yes.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.who,"{WHO ARE YOU?} Who are you? You look like the infected, but I can tell you don't act like one."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.who_reply,I am one of the purifiers. A bearer of the blessing.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.blessing,{A BLESSING?} A blessing? Do you mean the virus?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.blessing_reply,"Yes, a blessing only few may accept like we do. It makes us stronger, faster and better than you."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.purifiers,{PURIFIERS?} The Purifiers? What does that even mean?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.purifiers_reply,"It means that we'll make the world pure, without human scum."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.sabotage,{WHY DID YOU SABOTAGE US?} Why did you do all these things to our zone?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.sabotage_reply,"We have to stop you before you spread again and kill our brethren. Humanity is a failure. You killed the world, but it came back to life when the blessing took over. "
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.coexist,"{CAN WE COEXIST?} I get your idea, humans did all these terrible things. But do we need more bloodshed? Can't we try to live in peace, for once?"
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.coexist_reply,"No. You are not trustworthy. You've killed hundreds of ours without remorse, without even thinking they might be more than just monsters."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.defense,{WE DEFENDED OURSELVES} We were just defending ourselves.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.defense_reply,"Defending? Clearing our lairs, ever expanding your zones, killing us on sight wherever you went? You call that defense?!"
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.youkilled,{YOU KILLED PEOPLE} What about you? You've killed ours too. Why believe you won't fight your wars after you dispose of humans?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.youkilled_reply,We don't fight each other. We kill to cleanse.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.plan,{WHAT'S YOUR PLAN?} What's your plan then? How do you want to kill all of us?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.plan_reply,"Our plan is close to an end. You followed our transmission, and left your shelters. You're rebuilding, showing where you are. You're playing into our hands whatever you do. We'll cut off your heads, and our brethren will do the rest."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.miller,{WHAT ABOUT MILLER?} Did you kill Dr Miller and the entire science division? They did no harm to you. 
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.miller_reply,Wretched witch. She made a poison to stop our brethren. We made her pay. Her and all the others. Vaccine is a disgrace.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.plan_reply_2,{YOU WON'T GET AWAY} You won't get away with this. 
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.plan_reply_3,"We already have. We built our communities, and razed your zones. We lead the swarms. We're taking over and there's no stopping us."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.plan_reply_4,{LEAD THE SWARMS?} What? How are you able to lead the swarms?
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.plan_reply_5,"People made the blessing to kill each other. We accepted it, so that it could reforge us. Our infected brethren see us as their kin. They follow us."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.sick,{YOU'RE SICK} You're sick. You sentenced the world and all survivors to this sorry fate. Are you even aware how many died because of you?!
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.sick_reply,Not nearly enough. Humans are still killing thousands of ours every day. You are just a disease.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.stop,{} We will stop you!
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.stop_reply,"You cannot. You will accept our blessing, or die. We're already marching and in just a few days we'll swarm over you. I will say no more. Do what you must."
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.end,"What should we do with her, Chief?"
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.imprison,{IMPRISON HER} Keep her imprisoned.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.kill,{SHOOT HER} Just kill her already. She's of no use to us anymore. 
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.kill_sunlight,{EXPOSE TO SUN} Let's see if she can withstand the sun.
call_provirus_the_interrogation_2.dialog.release,{RELEASE} Throw her out of the zone. Now. 
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_escaped.dialog.1,Operator! The saboteur knocked down the guards and made her way underground. It's too dangerous to follow her down there.
dilemma_provirus_sabotage_escaped.dialog.opt_ok,{DAMN IT!} Damn it! We should've just killed her.
dilemma_provirus_siege.dialog.1,"Operator! They're coming, and in large numbers! We'd better get ready quickly!"
dilemma_provirus_siege.dialog.die,Your time has come. Destroy the vaccines and accept the blessing. You cannot stop us. 
dilemma_provirus_siege.dialog.opt_come,{BRING IT ON} You can't break us. Bring it on!
dilemma_provirus_siege.dialog.opt_stop,"{STOP THE ATTACK} Stop this madness, call off the hordes!"
dilemma_provirus_siege.dialog.opt_accept,{WE ACCEPT!} Wait! We accept your terms! We don't want to fight!
dilemma_provirus_siege.dialog.opt_accept_a,Wise choice. Drop your weapons and accept the blessing
dilemma_provirus_siege.dialog.die_2,"Die, vermin."
dilemma_provirus_siege_purifiers.dialog.1,Chief! They're not just ordinary infected! Some of them are carrying weapons! It must be more of those purifiers! 
dilemma_provirus_siege_purifiers.dialog.opt_ok,{SHOOT THEM} Shoot them first! They're the real danger!
dilemma_provirus_siege_2.dialog.1,"Chief, they're coming again, but... they've got vehicles and weapons! And they're leading the hordes! I never thought I'd see something like this!"
dilemma_provirus_siege_2.dialog.opt_ok,"{TO ARMS!} To arms, we need to stop them!"
dilemma_provirus_kill_the_leader.dialog.1,"Chief, I'm afraid they won't stop coming. We should find and take down their leader. Send squads to look for him or triangulate his signal. He must be on the move to coordinate everything."
dilemma_provirus_kill_the_leader.dialog.opt_ok,{LET'S FIND HIM} We have to find them. I'll dispatch squads.
dilemma_provirus_kill_the_leader.dialog.opt_ok_alt,{TRIANGULATE} We can triangulate his location. Wait for my orders. 
dilemma_provirus_siege_3.dialog.1,For the love of god! They've got armored vehicles now! 
dilemma_provirus_siege_3.dialog.opt_ok,"{GIVE THEM HELL} Strike them with everything we've got, we shall not fall!"
dilemma_provirus_leader_found.dialog.1,"Chief, we found him! It’s an armored command vehicle! We need all the firepower we can get to take it down!"
dilemma_provirus_leader_found.dialog.opt_wait,{WAIT FOR BACKUP} Wait until we gather a strike team.
dilemma_provirus_leader_found.dialog.opt_attack,{ATTACK} We have to attack now! Don't let him get away!
call_provirus_post_battle.dialog.1,"THIS IS NOT OVER. WE WILL PURGE YOU. WE ARE LEGION. WHEREVER YOU GO, WE WILL FOLLOW"
call_provirus_post_battle.dialog.opt_1,{WE WILL FIGHT} It doesn't matter. We'll come for you. All of you.
call_provirus_post_battle.dialog.opt_2,"{WE WILL BE READY} We'll be ready for you. Today, tomorrow, always. The zone will stand."
call_provirus_post_battle.dialog.opt_3,"{WE SHOULDN'T FIGHT} It would be better if we could live peacefully. But if we can't, so be it."
call_provirus_post_battle.dialog.purifier_die,Take him down!
call_provirus_post_battle.dialog.purifier_die_2,"Operator, this guy here looks like he was the leader. Those purifiers are mostly dead or dispersed and I think... Maybe the sun is yet to shine on us again."
call_provirus_post_battle.dialog.the_end,"{INFECTION FREE ZONE} Let's make the world a one, big Infection Free Zone."
dilemma_lore_lair.dialog.1,"Sir, we stumbled upon an old building which looked like a hobo hostel, except it was reeking of infected. Each room had a makeshift bedding made of rags, mattresses, and other soft things. One room also looked like some kind of storage with random items. Did they start to create lairs or something? "
dilemma_lore_lair.dialog.opt_leave,{LEAVE IT} Noted. Just leave the place.
dilemma_lore_lair.dialog.opt_search,{INVESTIGATE} Search this place.
dilemma_lore_kids.dialog.1,"Operator, this is big! In one of the houses, we killed two extremely fierce infected. Once they were down, we noticed that there was a child in there! A living, infected child, must’ve been no older than three! It ran like an animal and jumped into the sewers before we could get it. For the love of God, if they can multiply... I don't even want to think."
dilemma_lore_kids.dialog.opt_leave,{LET IT GO} Let it go. Poor kid suffered enough. 
dilemma_lore_kids.dialog.opt_search,{WE'LL TRY TO FIND IT} Try to find that kid. Keep it alive.
dilemma_lore_sunlight.dialog.1,"Sir, you won't believe what just happened! One of the infected just followed us outside. Into the sun! What’s even worse, he seemed to know exactly what he was doing. It took him a moment to give up, but then he returned to the darkness... What the hell is going on?!"
dilemma_lore_sunlight.dialog.opt_leave,{LEAVE IT} Noted. Just leave the place.
dilemma_lore_sunlight.dialog.opt_cleanse,{KILL IT} Better get back there and kill it!
dilemma_lore_sunlight.dialog.opt_capture,{CAPTURE HIM} What? Try to capture that one!
dilemma_lore_sunlight.dialog.opt_capture_ans,Capture? We don't have any equipment for that!
dilemma_lore_inf_tools.dialog.1,"Operator, we’ve found another lair. There were a lot of empty cans and other food containers, which looked like they had been smashed open with stones. Can the infected actually get such ideas? The bastards are getting smarter day by day."
dilemma_lore_inf_tools.dialog.opt_leave,{LEAVE IT} Noted. Just leave the place.
dilemma_lore_inf_tools.dialog.opt_search,{INVESTIGATE} Search this place.
dilemma_lore_gen_nature.dialog.1,"Chief, I've been looking around more recently, and I'm thinking... Everything’s turning green. Pure. We’re not masters of this world anymore."
dilemma_lore_gen_nature.dialog.opt_ok,{WHAT DO YOU MEAN?} What do you mean by that?
dilemma_lore_gen_nature.dialog.opt_notok,"{GET BACK TO WORK} Stop thinking, get back to scavenging."
dilemma_lore_gen_nature.dialog.branches,"Branches sticking out of windows and roots breaking through, as if the forest itself has come to reclaim the land. And all these animals around downtown… It's their world now... and the infected."
dilemma_lore_gen_nature.dialog.reclaim,{WE WILL RECLAIM} We will reclaim it.
dilemma_lore_gen_nature.dialog.itshould,"{JUST AS IT SHOULD} Maybe it should be like this, after all."
dilemma_lore_gen_nature.dialog.hunt,{HUNT THE ANIMALS} We might hunt animals for meat. Good job finding them.
dilemma_lore_inf_tools_investigate.dialog.1,"Boss, the infected... seem to be stacking food. We found a hidden stash of unopened cans in their lair. Can you believe that?! They're literally hiding stuff! They're not as mindless as we thought."
dilemma_lore_inf_tools_investigate.dialog.opt_ok,"{TAKE THEM} Take them, we can always use some food."
dilemma_lore_inf_tools_investigate.dialog.opt_notok,"{LEAVE THEM} Leave them, I don't trust this food."
dilemma_lore_virus_alpha.dialog.1,"WHAT THE HELL IS THAT?! Do you see that Chief?! It's not like any other infected, this thing is massive! It seems to be leading the entire swarm with its warcries! "
dilemma_lore_virus_alpha.dialog.opt_ok,{TAKE IT DOWN!} We have to take it down immediately!
dilemma_lore_virus_alpha.dialog.opt_leaveit,"{BETTER STAY AWAY} Better stay away from it, who knows what the infected will do once it's down."
dilemma_lore_kids_followup.dialog.1,"There's no sign of the child, Chief. We tried following it underground, but we couldn't get through. The hole it jumped into was too narrow for us. Jeez, maybe it wasn't a kid, but an animal or something else? Anyway, it got away for good. "
dilemma_lore_kids_followup.dialog.opt_ok,{HARD LUCK} Keep your eyes open. This thing might be important.
