dilemma_zone_raiders_camp.dialog.opt_settle,{LET'S SETTLE FIRST} First things first - let's set up a zone and deal with them later.
dilemma_zone_raiders_camp.dialog.opt_takeover,"{GET RID OF THEM} Good point, let's dispose of them and take over their HQ."
dilemma_zone_raiders_camp.dialog.opt_move,{} Let's choose another place to move to
dilemma_zone_nuclear.dialog.1,"Boss, this place is a wasteland. It looks like everything's been wiped out by a bombing raid or even a nuclear strike. We'll need to rebuild a lot, but it might be safe here."
dilemma_zone_nuclear.dialog.opt_ok,{} Let's settle here
dilemma_zone_nuclear.dialog.opt_move,{} Let's choose another place to move to
dilemma_zone_quiet.dialog.1,"Chief, this place seems quiet and peaceful. There are very few buildings here, if any. Seems like there won't be many people or infected around. We need to look out for animals though, it's a perfect place for them."
dilemma_zone_quiet.dialog.opt_ok,{} Let's settle here
dilemma_zone_quiet.dialog.opt_move,{} Let's choose another place to move to
dilemma_zone_abandoned.dialog.1,"Chief, there's an abandoned zone here. We can take over some of those buildings, it will be way easier than adapting them from scratch"
dilemma_zone_abandoned.dialog.opt_ok,{} Let's settle here
dilemma_zone_abandoned.dialog.opt_move,{} Let's choose another place to move to
dilemma_zone_normal.dialog.1,"Boss, this area is quite ordinary. We can expect the infected and raiders here as usual. We will have to set up our zone from scratch, like we did previously."
dilemma_zone_normal.dialog.opt_ok,{} Let's settle here
